<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.700" end="00:00:05.100" style="s2">10 bucks in my pocket, 3 million in</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.100" end="00:00:08.700" style="s2">debt.</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.100" end="00:00:08.700" style="s2">How am I supposed to live like this?</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.600" end="00:00:21.200" style="s2">Uh, we&#39;re closed. What Laram Group are</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.600" end="00:00:23.700" style="s2">you from? You&#39;re really committed.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.200" end="00:00:26.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shopkeeper of another world. I beg for</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.700" end="00:00:30.100" style="s2">water. My people are dying of thirst.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.200" end="00:00:30.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Water&#39;s in the cooler. 2 bucks a bottle.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.900" end="00:00:40.500" style="s2">You twist it off like this.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.500" end="00:00:47.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, shopkeeper. How much do I owe</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.700" end="00:00:51.600" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.800" end="00:00:51.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 20 bucks, four bottles.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.700" end="00:00:54.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that enough?</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.400" end="00:01:00.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.500" end="00:01:03.100" style="s2">This is real gold.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.500" end="00:01:04.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not enough? I have more.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.100" end="00:01:06.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough? Buddy, this is enough to buy the</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.800" end="00:01:08.300" style="s2">whole store. TAKE ALL THE WATER YOU</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.000" end="00:01:08.300" style="s2">WANT.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.400" end="00:01:12.500" style="s2">Where did the water go?</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.200" end="00:01:15.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The spatial ring. Standard equipment for</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.500" end="00:01:15.100" style="s2">a merchant.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.800" end="00:01:23.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My corner store connects to a fantasy</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.700" end="00:01:27.400" style="s2">world.</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.100" end="00:01:27.400" style="s2">Oh, I am going to get so rich.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.600" end="00:01:38.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are extraordinary. 24 karat pure</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.600" end="00:01:40.800" style="s2">gold, hand cast with a purity I&#39;ve only</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.900" end="00:01:42.900" style="s2">seen in museum middles.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.800" end="00:01:44.800" style="s2">Where did you say you found them?</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.900" end="00:01:47.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Family heirlooms from my grandmother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.800" end="00:01:48.800" style="s2">side. She was European.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.400" end="00:01:52.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.800" end="00:01:52.500" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you $8,000 for both.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.800" end="00:01:55.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.000" end="00:02:00.892" style="s2">8 grand for the lot.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.900" end="00:02:00.892" style="s2">I could this forever.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.092" end="00:02:07.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett, rushing from behind the</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.292" end="00:02:08.792" style="s2">counter. BORIN, WHAT HAPPENED to you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.092" end="00:02:10.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Blue Tower mages, they&#39;ve sealed our</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.792" end="00:02:12.692" style="s2">mountain. My clan, 400 dwarfs are</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.792" end="00:02:15.692" style="s2">starving.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.692" end="00:02:18.392" style="s2">The children are eating bark.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.692" end="00:02:18.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many people?</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.092" end="00:02:22.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 412 souls.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.492" end="00:02:27.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t do anything about a mage siege.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.992" end="00:02:29.341" style="s2">But food?</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.692" end="00:02:29.996" style="s2">We&#39;ve got plenty.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.341" end="00:02:31.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.996" end="00:02:33.392" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.392" end="00:02:35.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You would feed my people?</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.392" end="00:02:37.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 500 bags of rice, 200 cases of canned</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.592" end="00:02:40.592" style="s2">beans, 100 bags of flour. Can your ring</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.992" end="00:02:40.592" style="s2">hold all that?</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.392" end="00:02:44.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It can.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.792" end="00:02:44.692" style="s2">But I have nothing to pay you with, not</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.092" end="00:02:47.492" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.692" end="00:02:48.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then consider it a loan with interest.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.492" end="00:02:51.092" style="s2">You&#39;re a blacksmith, right?</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.892" end="00:02:52.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master Smith of the Stone Fist clan,</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.092" end="00:02:52.992" style="s2">third generation.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.092" end="00:02:54.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.992" end="00:02:56.992" style="s2">Once your people are fed, I want magical</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.692" end="00:02:59.292" style="s2">items. Specifically, things ordinary</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.992" end="00:03:00.692" style="s2">people can use. No mana required.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.292" end="00:03:03.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I was an apprentice, I made a</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.692" end="00:03:05.692" style="s2">bracer. Reflection runes. It can deflect</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.392" end="00:03:07.092" style="s2">any attack below archmage level. Even a</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.692" end="00:03:10.092" style="s2">mortal can wear it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.092" end="00:03:11.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect. Bring it tomorrow. And Borin?</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.092" end="00:03:15.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, shopkeeper?</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.892" end="00:03:15.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell your people they&#39;ll eat tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.892" end="00:03:27.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stone Fist remembers its debts.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.092" end="00:03:31.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I charge interest.</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.592" end="00:03:40.792" style="s2">Hi. Yeah, I need to place a big order.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.792" end="00:03:44.292" style="s2">Rice, beans, flour, canned goods. No,</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.792" end="00:03:44.292" style="s2">that&#39;s not enough. Double it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.392" end="00:03:51.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No money for the debt, BUT MONEY FOR</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.792" end="00:03:53.192" style="s2">RICE?</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.592" end="00:03:54.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank Kowalski owes the money. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.192" end="00:03:56.492" style="s2">sign anything.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.792" end="00:04:00.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care who signed.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.492" end="00:04:00.592" style="s2">You&#39;re going to pay sooner or later.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.292" end="00:04:07.794" style="s2">Tony?</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.194" end="00:04:11.094" style="s2">I&#39;m 20 years old. I live in a bodega.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.794" end="00:04:13.394" style="s2">I&#39;ve got nothing. You want 10 grand?</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.094" end="00:04:15.894" style="s2">Stab me, I bleed out and die</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.394" end="00:04:17.794" style="s2">and you get zero.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.894" end="00:04:21.494" style="s2">Or you take two grand right now as a</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.794" end="00:04:21.494" style="s2">finder&#39;s fee and go hunt down Frank.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.967" end="00:04:27.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.494" end="00:04:29.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two grand.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.094" end="00:04:31.883" style="s2">You better pray I find him.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.863" end="00:04:31.883" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.394" end="00:04:36.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that&#39;s more like it. Cash or Venmo?</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.694" end="00:04:47.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My clan sent me to thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.394" end="00:04:50.894" style="s2">The children ate hot porridge for the</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.694" end="00:04:50.894" style="s2">first time in three weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.894" end="00:04:57.094" style="s2">Reflection rune bracer. It activates</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.994" end="00:04:59.694" style="s2">automatically when attacked.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.094" end="00:05:01.394" style="s2">Any blow, fist, blade, arrow, even</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.694" end="00:05:03.894" style="s2">low-level magic bounces back at the</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.394" end="00:05:04.894" style="s2">attacker.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.894" end="00:05:05.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like something from a thrift</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.894" end="00:05:06.894" style="s2">store.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.594" end="00:05:07.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the point.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.894" end="00:05:10.594" style="s2">The best armor is the kind no one</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.994" end="00:05:10.594" style="s2">suspects.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.094" end="00:05:16.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did it just activate?</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.994" end="00:05:19.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Responded to you. It&#39;s active now.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.294" end="00:05:22.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tony Rigo, you son of a [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.194" end="00:05:22.094" style="s2">Try touching me again.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.083" end="00:05:53.894" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.594" end="00:05:57.394" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.894" end="00:05:57.394" style="s2">It works. It really works.</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.294" end="00:06:01.794" style="s2">Hello? Is this the police?</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.495" end="00:06:09.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Incredible.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.095" end="00:06:11.195" style="s2">The dimensional resonance here,</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.995" end="00:06:13.095" style="s2">unprecedented.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.195" end="00:06:15.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me guess. You&#39;re from the fantasy</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.095" end="00:06:19.395" style="s2">world, too? Food? Water?</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.895" end="00:06:19.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, I want this.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.695" end="00:06:23.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, let go.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.195" end="00:06:37.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Incredible.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.495" end="00:06:39.095" style="s2">Immortal wearing a refraction grade</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.195" end="00:06:40.795" style="s2">artifact.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.095" end="00:06:41.895" style="s2">You have no idea what you have, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.795" end="00:06:43.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know it just threw you across my</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.895" end="00:06:47.095" style="s2">store.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.595" end="00:06:47.095" style="s2">And I know you owe me for these beans.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.595" end="00:06:50.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologies.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.795" end="00:06:52.395" style="s2">I am Elias Ashford, Master Alchemist of</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.795" end="00:06:55.095" style="s2">the Valerian Alchemist Guild. Well,</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.395" end="00:06:57.195" style="s2">former Master Alchemist.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.095" end="00:06:59.695" style="s2">I was exiled. I need artifacts to</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.195" end="00:07:02.795" style="s2">survive.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.695" end="00:07:05.595" style="s2">And I have something you might want.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.795" end="00:07:07.395" style="s2">Potions, elixirs for healing, for curing</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.595" end="00:07:09.795" style="s2">illness, for extending life. In your</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.395" end="00:07:10.795" style="s2">world, these would be</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.795" end="00:07:11.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Worth a fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.795" end="00:07:13.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Precisely.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.995" end="00:07:16.295" style="s2">So, shopkeeper,</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.395" end="00:07:16.295" style="s2">shall we discuss a trade?</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.295" end="00:07:24.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, these potions, an ordinary person</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.195" end="00:07:24.695" style="s2">can&#39;t drink them?</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.395" end="00:07:29.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Most contain condensed mana. Immortal</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.495" end="00:07:31.595" style="s2">who drinks them would burst.</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.895" end="00:07:32.795" style="s2">But healing salves and topical elixirs</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.595" end="00:07:34.495" style="s2">are safe.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.795" end="00:07:38.495" style="s2">And the rarest, the soul cleansing</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.495" end="00:07:40.095" style="s2">elixir can be diluted for mortal use.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.495" end="00:07:41.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.095" end="00:07:43.795" style="s2">Don&#39;t drink the glowing ones.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.895" end="00:07:46.695" style="s2">Rub those on your skin. The expensive</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.795" end="00:07:46.695" style="s2">one gets watered down.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.895" end="00:07:51.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have a remarkably practical mind.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.295" end="00:07:57.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I owe a mob family 200 grand.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.195" end="00:07:58.995" style="s2">Practicality is the only thing I&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.495" end="00:08:00.295" style="s2">on me. You look like you haven&#39;t eaten a</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.995" end="00:08:02.295" style="s2">week.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.295" end="00:08:02.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.705" end="00:08:06.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.297" end="00:08:13.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By the gods,</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.897" end="00:08:16.997" style="s2">what is this?</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.097" end="00:08:16.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Big Mac. Welcome to America.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.497" end="00:08:38.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; real artifacts.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.420" end="00:08:42.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.097" end="00:08:42.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is this</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.097" end="00:08:49.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; food from her world. Eat.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.797" end="00:09:02.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t eaten meat in months. The</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.197" end="00:09:04.297" style="s2">guild cut our stipend the day they</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.897" end="00:09:05.897" style="s2">exiled us.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.297" end="00:09:07.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll regret it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.897" end="00:09:09.797" style="s2">The shopkeeper,</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.197" end="00:09:11.797" style="s2">Scarlett, agreed to trade. I gave her 20</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.797" end="00:09:13.397" style="s2">vials of potion. She&#39;ll help us find</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.797" end="00:09:15.797" style="s2">artifacts.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.397" end="00:09:19.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be careful, boy. If the guild finds out</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.797" end="00:09:19.297" style="s2">you&#39;re trading across worlds</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.697" end="00:09:25.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them find out.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.497" end="00:09:25.497" style="s2">By the time they do,</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.397" end="00:09:31.197" style="s2">we&#39;ll have more artifacts than the guild</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.497" end="00:09:31.197" style="s2">has gold.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.197" end="00:09:37.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BENNETT,</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.297" end="00:09:39.597" style="s2">OPEN UP. WE NEED TO TALK ABOUT YOUR</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.097" end="00:09:39.597" style="s2">DEBT.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.797" end="00:09:45.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TONY,</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.897" end="00:09:46.297" style="s2">WE ALREADY TALKED.</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.297" end="00:09:49.297" style="s2">GO find Frank.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.297" end="00:09:49.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M DONE TALKING.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.697" end="00:10:03.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 200 FOR THE BAT. Medical pales, those</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.697" end="00:10:04.697" style="s2">are on you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.097" end="00:10:05.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell are you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.697" end="00:10:07.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the girl you should never have</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.697" end="00:10:09.197" style="s2">messed with. Now get off my sidewalk and</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.797" end="00:10:13.198" style="s2">tell your boss</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.197" end="00:10:13.198" style="s2">I&#39;ll it on my terms.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.998" end="00:10:26.298" style="s2">Best deal I&#39;ve ever made.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.698" end="00:10:36.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shopkeeper,</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.998" end="00:10:36.598" style="s2">my clan survived because of you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.098" end="00:10:45.398" style="s2">These are for you</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.398" end="00:10:47.398" style="s2">to settle the food debt.</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.398" end="00:10:50.198" style="s2">And this he picks up the jade pendant is</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.398" end="00:10:51.398" style="s2">a gift from the clan elders.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.198" end="00:10:52.398" style="s2">The small healing spell is sealed</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.398" end="00:10:55.198" style="s2">inside.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.398" end="00:10:55.198" style="s2">Wear it when you&#39;re hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.098" end="00:11:01.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.598" end="00:11:03.498" style="s2">But Borin, I can&#39;t accept a gift.</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.198" end="00:11:06.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You fed 400 children.</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.498" end="00:11:06.498" style="s2">You must accept it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.598" end="00:11:20.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.698" end="00:11:22.698" style="s2">But interest on the next shipment.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.198" end="00:11:24.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dwarf in interest or human interest?</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.698" end="00:11:24.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.298" end="00:11:30.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett,</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.598" end="00:11:33.598" style="s2">this jade</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.198" end="00:11:33.598" style="s2">is like no jade I&#39;ve ever seen.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.798" end="00:11:41.498" style="s2">The color saturation, the internal</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.698" end="00:11:43.698" style="s2">structure, it&#39;s not in the GIA database.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.498" end="00:11:45.198" style="s2">And these carvings not Chinese,</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.698" end="00:11:47.998" style="s2">not Mayan, not from any known</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.198" end="00:11:47.998" style="s2">civilization.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.798" end="00:11:52.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So,</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.398" end="00:11:56.298" style="s2">what&#39;s it worth?</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.998" end="00:11:57.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To the right collector, priceless.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.298" end="00:12:00.898" style="s2">To a museum,</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.998" end="00:12:03.098" style="s2">they&#39;d rewrite the history books.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.898" end="00:12:04.598" style="s2">I have a client, a private collector in</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.098" end="00:12:08.298" style="s2">Geneva who&#39;s been searching for</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.598" end="00:12:08.298" style="s2">something like this for 20 years.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.798" end="00:12:15.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me a number, Edmund.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.898" end="00:12:18.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $350,000.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.399" end="00:12:18.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and I&#39;m undervaluing it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.899" end="00:12:25.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal. But Edmund, I need to ask you</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.999" end="00:12:25.399" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.799" end="00:12:29.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask away.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.999" end="00:12:33.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That 3 million in debt on my store, who</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.599" end="00:12:33.199" style="s2">actually holds it? Tell me straight.</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.799" end="00:12:37.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t want to know.</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.499" end="00:12:37.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.099" end="00:12:42.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The original loan was 300,000 taken out</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.499" end="00:12:44.299" style="s2">8 months ago by Frank Kowalski, rolled</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.999" end="00:12:46.199" style="s2">and refinanced through three shell</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.299" end="00:12:47.999" style="s2">companies until it became 3 million. The</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.199" end="00:12:52.099" style="s2">final holder, a company called Northbook</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.999" end="00:12:52.099" style="s2">Properties, owned by the Moretti family.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.899" end="00:13:01.099" style="s2">And the land under your store,</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.099" end="00:13:03.699" style="s2">it&#39;s zoned for a high-rise</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.099" end="00:13:05.599" style="s2">worth 15 million.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.699" end="00:13:06.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They never wanted the money.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.599" end="00:13:08.499" style="s2">They wanted the store.</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.499" end="00:13:10.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They wanted the land.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.499" end="00:13:12.199" style="s2">As for Frank,</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.099" end="00:13:14.699" style="s2">he took the money, ran up the debt, and</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.199" end="00:13:14.699" style="s2">vanished.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.099" end="00:13:21.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Edmund, from now on, I&#39;ll bring you more</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.799" end="00:13:24.499" style="s2">things you&#39;ve never seen,</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.299" end="00:13:24.499" style="s2">things that shouldn&#39;t exist.</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.899" end="00:13:29.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been waiting to hear you say that.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.299" end="00:13:40.299" style="s2">This is a warding amulet, third tier.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.699" end="00:13:42.899" style="s2">This bracer carries a strength rune.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.299" end="00:13:42.899" style="s2">And this,</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.999" end="00:13:47.099" style="s2">a mind bell.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.499" end="00:13:48.899" style="s2">It can stun anyone below the rank of</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.099" end="00:13:50.299" style="s2">abject mage. Extraordinary</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.899" end="00:13:52.299" style="s2">craftsmanship.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.299" end="00:13:53.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So all of these can be sold?</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.299" end="00:13:55.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every single one.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.899" end="00:13:57.799" style="s2">They&#39;d fetch fortunes in Eldaria. In</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.699" end="00:13:58.999" style="s2">Valyria, nobles would duel over them.</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.799" end="00:14:00.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.999" end="00:14:02.399" style="s2">Then I want you to take them back and</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.399" end="00:14:04.799" style="s2">sell them.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.399" end="00:14:07.199" style="s2">Highest bidder wins. I want the proceeds</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.799" end="00:14:09.199" style="s2">in mana crystals.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.199" end="00:14:10.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want mana crystals?</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.199" end="00:14:12.299" style="s2">But but you can&#39;t use them.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.799" end="00:14:14.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t use them,</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.299" end="00:14:17.001" style="s2">but Harrington can sell them.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.599" end="00:14:18.401" style="s2">Call them rare mineral specimens, the</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.001" end="00:14:21.001" style="s2">kind billionaires keep in private</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.401" end="00:14:21.001" style="s2">collections.</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.954" end="00:14:27.284" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.264" end="00:14:27.284" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.401" end="00:14:31.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re terrifying and brilliant.</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.101" end="00:14:34.701" style="s2">I&#39;ll sell them, but I want something in</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.801" end="00:14:36.701" style="s2">return. A ring of holding, a real one,</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.701" end="00:14:40.401" style="s2">not one of those cheap pouches</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.701" end="00:14:40.401" style="s2">the guild took mine when they exiled me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.201" end="00:14:46.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ring of holding, nodded. I&#39;ll ask Borin.</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.801" end="00:14:53.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who wants a ring of holding?</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.101" end="00:15:04.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apprentice grade work. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.301" end="00:15:04.301" style="s2">About 100 cubic feet of space in each.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.601" end="00:15:08.801" style="s2">Nothing fancy, but they work.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.601" end="00:15:16.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 100 cubic. Do you know what a ring like</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.801" end="00:15:20.501" style="s2">this sells for in Valyria?</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.901" end="00:15:23.301" style="s2">50,000 mana crystals.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.501" end="00:15:23.301" style="s2">Starting price.</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.301" end="00:15:28.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We make them in batches. The Blue Tower</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.301" end="00:15:29.601" style="s2">buys them for 10 crystals and resells</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.201" end="00:15:32.901" style="s2">for 500.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.601" end="00:15:32.901" style="s2">Monopoly, you know how it is.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.101" end="00:15:37.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Monopoly.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.401" end="00:15:39.601" style="s2">Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.101" end="00:15:42.101" style="s2">And what if someone started selling</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.601" end="00:15:44.001" style="s2">rings of holding at a fair price?</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.101" end="00:15:45.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Blue Tower would lose their minds.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.001" end="00:15:46.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Alchemist&#39;s Guild would have a heart</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.501" end="00:15:48.450" style="s2">attack.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.801" end="00:15:50.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gentlemen,</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.450" end="00:15:50.470" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.101" end="00:15:56.401" style="s2">I believe we just found ourselves a</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.601" end="00:15:56.401" style="s2">business model.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.901" end="00:16:07.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The mind bell, a remarkable artifact of</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.101" end="00:16:09.901" style="s2">unknown origin, capable of stunning</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.201" end="00:16:12.686" style="s2">anyone below the rank of adept mage.</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.901" end="00:16:14.101" style="s2">BIDDING OPENS AT 5,000 MANA CRYSTALS.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.686" end="00:16:15.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.101" end="00:16:18.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 80,000.</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.401" end="00:16:18.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 100,000.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.302" end="00:16:26.302" style="s2">200,000.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.902" end="00:16:31.902" style="s2">Where did you obtain this?</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.002" end="00:16:34.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From a merchant one</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.902" end="00:16:34.802" style="s2">from beyond this world.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.202" end="00:16:41.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beyond this world? Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.502" end="00:16:41.702" style="s2">I should like to meet this merchant.</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.902" end="00:16:54.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett,</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.302" end="00:16:56.402" style="s2">this is Prince Valerius of Valeria. He</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.402" end="00:16:57.402" style="s2">bought the mind bell. He wants to meet</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.402" end="00:16:59.302" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.402" end="00:17:00.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness, welcome to Bennett&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.302" end="00:17:02.302" style="s2">Corner.</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.702" end="00:17:05.002" style="s2">Can I get you anything?</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.302" end="00:17:07.902" style="s2">Water, beer? We also have those little</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.002" end="00:17:07.902" style="s2">pickles in a jar.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.302" end="00:17:18.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These they dim the sunlight. Are they</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.002" end="00:17:22.502" style="s2">enchanted?</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.902" end="00:17:22.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re sunglasses. Five bucks.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.502" end="00:17:29.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In Eldoria, a crystal that blocks the</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.302" end="00:17:30.802" style="s2">sun is worth a kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.302" end="00:17:32.302" style="s2">Here it costs</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.802" end="00:17:35.802" style="s2">five of your dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.302" end="00:17:35.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome to Global Manufacturing.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.302" end="00:17:42.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Bennett,</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.802" end="00:17:43.902" style="s2">I shall not waste your time.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.302" end="00:17:45.902" style="s2">I want exclusive distribution rights to</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.902" end="00:17:47.702" style="s2">your artifacts in Valeria.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.902" end="00:17:49.002" style="s2">In return, I offer my patronage,</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.702" end="00:17:50.602" style="s2">protection from the Blue Tower, the</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.002" end="00:17:51.502" style="s2">guild, and any power that threatens your</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.602" end="00:17:55.702" style="s2">trade.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.502" end="00:17:55.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exclusive rights? That&#39;s a big ask.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.802" end="00:18:00.202" style="s2">What about the elves who want to trade,</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.302" end="00:18:02.502" style="s2">the dwarfs?</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.202" end="00:18:04.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not exclusive across all worlds.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.502" end="00:18:05.602" style="s2">Exclusive within the human kingdoms.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.102" end="00:18:07.002" style="s2">Dwarfs and other powers may deal with</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.602" end="00:18:10.102" style="s2">you directly.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.002" end="00:18:13.202" style="s2">But in Valeria and its allied realms,</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.102" end="00:18:13.202" style="s2">I am your sole distributor.</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.302" end="00:18:17.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.302" end="00:18:18.402" style="s2">But I have conditions.</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.402" end="00:18:20.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Name them.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.402" end="00:18:22.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, you protect Borin&#39;s clan, the</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.302" end="00:18:24.503" style="s2">Stone Dwarves. No more Blue Tower</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.003" end="00:18:26.203" style="s2">sieges. Second, you help Elias back into</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.503" end="00:18:27.603" style="s2">the Alchemist Guild or help him found</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.203" end="00:18:30.003" style="s2">his own.</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.603" end="00:18:32.857" style="s2">Third, when I supply you, you pay fair</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.003" end="00:18:34.877" style="s2">market price. No prince discount.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.857" end="00:18:34.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.103" end="00:18:38.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bargain better than my father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.403" end="00:18:40.103" style="s2">Chancellor of the Ex story. Agreed, all</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.403" end="00:18:42.003" style="s2">three.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.103" end="00:18:43.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome to the family, Your Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.003" end="00:18:44.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call me Valerius.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.603" end="00:18:48.003" style="s2">I believe this is the beginning of a</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.703" end="00:18:48.003" style="s2">very profitable partnership.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.903" end="00:18:54.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEAR ME ALL OF YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.703" end="00:18:56.303" style="s2">THIS FOOD comes from a merchant,</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.503" end="00:18:57.403" style="s2">Scarlett Bennett, from a world beyond</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.303" end="00:18:59.703" style="s2">our own.</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.403" end="00:19:02.403" style="s2">She chose to feed us.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.703" end="00:19:04.503" style="s2">In return, we forge.</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.403" end="00:19:07.403" style="s2">We will forge as the Stone-feared clan</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.503" end="00:19:10.193" style="s2">has never forged before. Artifacts,</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.403" end="00:19:11.203" style="s2">RINGS OF HOLDING, WEAPONS.</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.193" end="00:19:12.803" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.203" end="00:19:14.403" style="s2">She sells them</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.803" end="00:19:16.203" style="s2">and we eat.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.403" end="00:19:18.503" style="s2">AND ONE DAY, [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.203" end="00:19:21.503" style="s2">ONE DAY, WE WILL THROW OFF THE YOKE OF</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.503" end="00:19:21.503" style="s2">THE BLUE TOWER.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.703" end="00:19:29.503" style="s2">MY GRANDSON ATE MEAT TODAY.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.903" end="00:19:29.503" style="s2">First time in his life.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.203" end="00:19:33.103" style="s2">Thank you, Scarlett.</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.403" end="00:19:38.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO MORE GAMES. EITHER YOU PAY UP OR I</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.103" end="00:19:40.203" style="s2">BURN THIS PLACE TO THE GROUND.</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.503" end="00:19:42.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TONY, how many times have we talked? I</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.203" end="00:19:43.703" style="s2">told you I&#39;ll pay the debt on my terms.</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.003" end="00:19:46.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your terms? I DON&#39;T GIVE A DAMN ABOUT</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.703" end="00:19:46.403" style="s2">YOUR TERMS.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.603" end="00:19:53.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHO&#39;S NEXT?</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.703" end="00:19:57.903" style="s2">HI, YEAH, I&#39;D LIKE TO file a police</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.803" end="00:20:01.003" style="s2">report and an insurance claim and</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.903" end="00:20:01.003" style="s2">possibly a restraining order.</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.203" end="00:20:08.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heard there was trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.203" end="00:20:08.703" style="s2">Are you all right?</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.203" end="00:20:12.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. They just wrecked my chip</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.803" end="00:20:15.303" style="s2">rack. Those were good chips.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.303" end="00:20:17.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The jade sold</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.303" end="00:20:19.003" style="s2">along with the other pieces you left.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.303" end="00:20:20.403" style="s2">The jade alone,</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.003" end="00:20:23.403" style="s2">the other pieces brought in another</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.403" end="00:20:23.403" style="s2">420,000.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.305" end="00:20:28.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $700,000?</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.405" end="00:20:30.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $700,000.</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.605" end="00:20:32.005" style="s2">And Scarlett, that client of mine in</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.205" end="00:20:34.205" style="s2">Geneva,</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.005" end="00:20:36.305" style="s2">he wants more. Says he&#39;ll buy whatever</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.205" end="00:20:38.305" style="s2">you bring at any price.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.305" end="00:20:39.929" style="s2">He calls your pieces impossible</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.305" end="00:20:41.305" style="s2">artifacts.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.929" end="00:20:42.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.305" end="00:20:44.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Edmund,</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.405" end="00:20:45.505" style="s2">the debt is 3 million.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.805" end="00:20:47.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.505" end="00:20:50.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At this rate, I&#39;ll clear it in 2 months.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.905" end="00:20:52.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At this rate, you&#39;ll be a millionaire by</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.305" end="00:20:55.505" style="s2">Christmas.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.205" end="00:20:55.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s get to work.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.579" end="00:21:01.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.005" end="00:21:03.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they think sunglasses are enchanted,</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.705" end="00:21:05.805" style="s2">they&#39;ll lose their minds over a Swiss</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.205" end="00:21:05.805" style="s2">Army knife.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.705" end="00:21:14.005" style="s2">500 pairs of sunglasses,</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.805" end="00:21:16.805" style="s2">1,000 lighters, the Zippo kind, they</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.005" end="00:21:16.805" style="s2">love the click.</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.705" end="00:21:26.705" style="s2">2,000 plastic storage bins.</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.205" end="00:21:31.205" style="s2">Thor and your clan can use them for</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.505" end="00:21:31.205" style="s2">sorting ore.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.405" end="00:21:38.705" style="s2">500 watches, analog. The ticking</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.905" end="00:21:42.005" style="s2">fascinates them. 300 Swiss Army knives,</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.705" end="00:21:42.005" style="s2">500 first aid kits.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.605" end="00:21:46.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Inside this one knife, a blade, a saw,</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.905" end="00:21:48.305" style="s2">scissors, a bottle opener, a file, a</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.205" end="00:21:50.705" style="s2">screwdriver. How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.305" end="00:21:53.290" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Swiss engineering, 18 bucks.</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.705" end="00:21:54.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Antiseptic, bandages, painkillers.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.290" end="00:21:56.305" style="s2">[snorts] The guild sells a single vial</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.505" end="00:21:57.705" style="s2">of healing cell for 50 mana crystals.</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.305" end="00:22:00.105" style="s2">This whole kit costs</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.705" end="00:22:00.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 12 bucks.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.205" end="00:22:03.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to be richer than the Blue</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.305" end="00:22:03.805" style="s2">Tower.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.005" end="00:22:08.405" style="s2">We&#39;re already richer than them.</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.105" end="00:22:10.105" style="s2">They just don&#39;t know it yet.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.405" end="00:22:11.805" style="s2">Mr. Harrington,</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.105" end="00:22:14.205" style="s2">we&#39;re investigating a series of unusual</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.805" end="00:22:16.205" style="s2">financial transactions.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.205" end="00:22:17.905" style="s2">Large cash deposits,</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.205" end="00:22:20.205" style="s2">sales [snorts] of artifacts of unknown</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.905" end="00:22:23.105" style="s2">origin. We understand you facilitated</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.205" end="00:22:25.505" style="s2">some of these sales.</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.105" end="00:22:27.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I run an antique gallery agent. I buy</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.505" end="00:22:27.606" style="s2">and sell rare objects. That&#39;s not a</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.006" end="00:22:29.806" style="s2">crime.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.606" end="00:22:32.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These objects have been tested. The gold</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.806" end="00:22:34.406" style="s2">is 24 karat with an isotope signature</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.406" end="00:22:36.306" style="s2">that matches no known deposit. The</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.406" end="00:22:38.206" style="s2">jade&#39;s molecular structure is</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.306" end="00:22:39.506" style="s2">theoretically impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.206" end="00:22:41.306" style="s2">And the gems?</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.506" end="00:22:43.706" style="s2">Flawless. That purity doesn&#39;t exist in</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.306" end="00:22:43.706" style="s2">nature.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.906" end="00:22:49.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you accusing me of something, agent?</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.906" end="00:22:51.106" style="s2">Or asking me questions?</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.006" end="00:22:54.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re asking for your cooperation.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.106" end="00:22:54.406" style="s2">Who supplies you with these items?</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.515" end="00:22:57.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.606" end="00:22:59.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A private collector who wishes to remain</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.506" end="00:23:02.306" style="s2">anonymous. Unless you have a warrant,</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.106" end="00:23:02.306" style="s2">this conversation is over.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.006" end="00:23:06.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll be in touch, Mr. Harrington.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.106" end="00:23:13.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett, we have a problem. The FBI is</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.606" end="00:23:17.406" style="s2">asking questions.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.606" end="00:23:19.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The FBI? Great. Just great.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.406" end="00:23:21.706" style="s2">I&#39;m running a cross-dimensional trade</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.006" end="00:23:23.306" style="s2">empire out of a Chicago bodega, and the</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.706" end="00:23:25.206" style="s2">feds are on my tail.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.306" end="00:23:26.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In our world, we challenge them to</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.206" end="00:23:28.806" style="s2">single combat.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.506" end="00:23:30.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t your world. In my world, the</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.806" end="00:23:33.106" style="s2">FBI has guns, warrants, and forensic</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.806" end="00:23:34.406" style="s2">accountants.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.106" end="00:23:37.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.406" end="00:23:37.206" style="s2">you went legitimate?</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.506" end="00:23:39.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.406" end="00:23:41.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have artifacts. What if you</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.806" end="00:23:43.006" style="s2">registered a company, a legitimate</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.206" end="00:23:44.506" style="s2">import-export firm, and laundered the</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.006" end="00:23:46.206" style="s2">trade through it? The artifacts become</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.506" end="00:23:47.906" style="s2">imported handicrafts. The money becomes</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.206" end="00:23:49.206" style="s2">business revenue.</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.906" end="00:23:52.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.206" end="00:23:52.306" style="s2">actually really smart.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.406" end="00:23:58.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I read a book on economics</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.406" end="00:24:00.506" style="s2">from your world.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.206" end="00:24:02.106" style="s2">Quite fascinating.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.506" end="00:24:03.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bennett imports and exports, register</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.106" end="00:24:05.906" style="s2">the company. Harrington is the front</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.806" end="00:24:08.006" style="s2">man. We say we import Eastern European</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.906" end="00:24:10.506" style="s2">handicrafts. The artifacts get</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.006" end="00:24:12.306" style="s2">appraised, insured, and sold through</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.506" end="00:24:14.006" style="s2">legal channels.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.306" end="00:24:15.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the mana crystals?</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.006" end="00:24:17.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rare mineral specimens, sold to</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.806" end="00:24:20.106" style="s2">collectors and research institutions.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.906" end="00:24:21.506" style="s2">Full documentation.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.106" end="00:24:24.406" style="s2">We&#39;re not criminals.</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.506" end="00:24:25.806" style="s2">We&#39;re merchants.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.406" end="00:24:28.406" style="s2">Time to start doing business like</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.806" end="00:24:28.406" style="s2">merchants.</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.706" end="00:24:34.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elias Ashfield,</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.807" end="00:24:35.408" style="s2">you were exiled from this guild six</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.007" end="00:24:37.807" style="s2">months ago.</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.408" end="00:24:39.507" style="s2">Now you return, flaunting artifacts you</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.807" end="00:24:41.807" style="s2">have no right to, selling them at</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.507" end="00:24:43.207" style="s2">auction for outrageous sums. Explain</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.807" end="00:24:45.307" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.207" end="00:24:47.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I traded for them, Grand Elder.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.307" end="00:24:50.807" style="s2">Fair trade</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.408" end="00:24:50.807" style="s2">with a merchant from another world.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.707" end="00:24:55.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A merchant from another world? You</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.807" end="00:24:58.607" style="s2">expect us to believe this fairy tale?</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.707" end="00:25:00.007" style="s2">You stole them FROM THE GUILD VAULT!</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.607" end="00:25:02.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The guild vault hasn&#39;t produced</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.007" end="00:25:05.007" style="s2">artifacts of that quality in 200 years.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.908" end="00:25:07.207" style="s2">You know it, Marcus. Everyone here knows</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.007" end="00:25:07.207" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.408" end="00:25:12.107" style="s2">I believe I can shed some light on this.</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.408" end="00:25:17.908" style="s2">These come from the same merchant.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.408" end="00:25:17.908" style="s2">They block the sun without magic.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.607" end="00:25:25.607" style="s2">For just five of her dollars, roughly</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.207" end="00:25:27.807" style="s2">1/10 of a mana crystal.</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.607" end="00:25:30.507" style="s2">The merchant is real.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.807" end="00:25:32.807" style="s2">The artifacts are real.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.507" end="00:25:35.507" style="s2">Elias Ashfield is her authorized</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.807" end="00:25:36.107" style="s2">representative in Valoria by royal</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.507" end="00:25:38.908" style="s2">ordain.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.107" end="00:25:41.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness, THIS IS HIGHLY IRREGULAR.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.908" end="00:25:43.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT&#39;S IRREGULAR, Grand Elder? Is your</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.307" end="00:25:46.607" style="s2">guild selling a healing salve that costs</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.307" end="00:25:48.408" style="s2">less than one crystal to make for 50?</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.607" end="00:25:49.908" style="s2">What&#39;s irregular is you exiling Elias</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.408" end="00:25:53.107" style="s2">and his master for refusing to surrender</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.908" end="00:25:53.107" style="s2">their family recipes.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.007" end="00:25:59.107" style="s2">Is that this guild has become a</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.408" end="00:26:01.107" style="s2">monopoly, pricing life itself beyond the</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.107" end="00:26:03.507" style="s2">reach and reach of ordinary people. From</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.107" end="00:26:06.007" style="s2">this day forward, the crown recognizes</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.507" end="00:26:07.707" style="s2">Elias Ashfield as a grand alchemist,</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.007" end="00:26:12.107" style="s2">independent of the guild. He may</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.707" end="00:26:12.107" style="s2">practice, teach, and sell freely.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.408" end="00:26:16.107" style="s2">The crown will review guild pricing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.107" end="00:26:25.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlet, it worked! The prince backs us.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.507" end="00:26:27.908" style="s2">I&#39;m free!</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.908" end="00:26:30.408" style="s2">And William, he came too. He wants to</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.908" end="00:26:30.408" style="s2">meet you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.908" end="00:26:35.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Bennett, my grandson says it was</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.209" end="00:26:37.909" style="s2">you who put food on our table tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.809" end="00:26:40.509" style="s2">who gave us back our freedom. I am in</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.909" end="00:26:40.509" style="s2">your debt.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.609" end="00:26:47.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; now.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.809" end="00:26:51.209" style="s2">eats free.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.609" end="00:26:51.209" style="s2">Corner. Help yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.509" end="00:26:58.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve lived 70 years and never known such</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.309" end="00:27:01.009" style="s2">kindness, not from the guild,</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.709" end="00:27:02.709" style="s2">not from the crown,</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.009" end="00:27:03.609" style="s2">but from a mortal girl in a corner</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.709" end="00:27:05.109" style="s2">store.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.609" end="00:27:06.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s because nobody ever gave them a</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.109" end="00:27:09.209" style="s2">reason to.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.609" end="00:27:09.209" style="s2">Now eat.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.509" end="00:27:13.409" style="s2">And tell me everything you know about</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.909" end="00:27:13.409" style="s2">alchemy,</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.809" end="00:27:20.509" style="s2">because I have a plan.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.009" end="00:27:28.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the Blue Tower is threatening to wipe</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.309" end="00:27:31.809" style="s2">out your clan unless you hand over</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.709" end="00:27:33.409" style="s2">everything you forged.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.809" end="00:27:35.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They found out.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.409" end="00:27:37.409" style="s2">Someone in the clan talked.</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.309" end="00:27:39.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Archmage Thorne gave us three days. Hand</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.409" end="00:27:40.109" style="s2">over everything or the stronghold gets</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.209" end="00:27:42.109" style="s2">fireball flat.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.109" end="00:27:43.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Valerius can&#39;t step in because the</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.109" end="00:27:45.909" style="s2">Blue Tower is technically a sovereign</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.709" end="00:27:47.109" style="s2">power outside Valeria.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.909" end="00:27:49.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Correct.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.109" end="00:27:51.309" style="s2">The Blue Tower swears fealty to no king.</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.509" end="00:27:54.009" style="s2">They are the most powerful mage order in</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.309" end="00:27:54.009" style="s2">the known world.</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.309" end="00:28:00.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.409" end="00:28:02.409" style="s2">Then we won&#39;t fight them with swords.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.109" end="00:28:05.109" style="s2">We&#39;ll fight them with economics.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.409" end="00:28:05.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Economics?</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.109" end="00:28:10.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Blue Tower&#39;s power comes from two</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.809" end="00:28:12.709" style="s2">things,</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.109" end="00:28:14.709" style="s2">magic and monopoly.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.709" end="00:28:16.209" style="s2">They control artifact production, rings</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.709" end="00:28:17.809" style="s2">of holding, and mana crystal</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.209" end="00:28:20.009" style="s2">distribution.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.809" end="00:28:21.709" style="s2">What if we undercut them?</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.009" end="00:28:23.909" style="s2">What if we start selling rings and</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.709" end="00:28:27.409" style="s2">artifacts to every kingdom, every power</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.909" end="00:28:27.409" style="s2">at a tenth of their price?</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.609" end="00:28:32.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You destroy their revenue base.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.509" end="00:28:35.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.709" end="00:28:38.110" style="s2">A mage order that can&#39;t pay its mages is</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.610" end="00:28:39.310" style="s2">just a bunch of people in robes.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.110" end="00:28:41.710" style="s2">While they&#39;re scrambling over their</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.310" end="00:28:44.710" style="s2">collapsing income, they won&#39;t have time</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.710" end="00:28:44.710" style="s2">to siege your clan.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.510" end="00:28:51.110" style="s2">How long can those shields hold?</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.410" end="00:28:52.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At current power output, about 6 hours.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.110" end="00:28:54.510" style="s2">Then the crystals run dry and the</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.310" end="00:28:55.810" style="s2">shields drop.</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.510" end="00:28:57.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we wait.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.810" end="00:28:59.510" style="s2">6 hours.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.410" end="00:29:01.310" style="s2">The moment those shields fall,</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.510" end="00:29:04.510" style="s2">we go in.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.310" end="00:29:09.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want us to forge for a mortal girl,</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.510" end="00:29:09.110" style="s2">sell our artifacts at half price?</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.310" end="00:29:14.310" style="s2">This is madness.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.810" end="00:29:16.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandfather,</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.310" end="00:29:17.810" style="s2">the blue tower will smolder us in 3</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.310" end="00:29:20.710" style="s2">days.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.810" end="00:29:23.210" style="s2">We have two choices. Fight and die or</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.710" end="00:29:25.110" style="s2">fight smart and live.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.210" end="00:29:26.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlet&#39;s plan works.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.110" end="00:29:28.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s already fed us. She&#39;s already</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.710" end="00:29:32.210" style="s2">given us rings of holding.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.610" end="00:29:32.210" style="s2">She&#39;s the reason we&#39;re still alive.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.710" end="00:29:42.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if this economics fails</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.410" end="00:29:44.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we fight.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.210" end="00:29:47.010" style="s2">But at least we&#39;ll be fed and better</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.510" end="00:29:47.010" style="s2">armed.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.310" end="00:29:53.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Stone Fist clan has survived a</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.410" end="00:29:55.510" style="s2">thousand years</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.410" end="00:29:59.110" style="s2">by being smarter than its enemies.</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.510" end="00:30:02.580" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If this girl is as clever as you say,</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.110" end="00:30:04.600" style="s2">FORGE. FORGE WITH EVERYTHING WE HAVE.</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.580" end="00:30:04.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.475" end="00:30:10.495" style="s2">[cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.310" end="00:30:14.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $8 million</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.910" end="00:30:18.010" style="s2">for a belt</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.710" end="00:30:18.010" style="s2">a belt that stuns people.</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.310" end="00:30:23.610" style="s2">And what did it cost me to get it from</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.710" end="00:30:25.910" style="s2">Borin?</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.610" end="00:30:28.126" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few bags of rice, maybe $200 of</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.910" end="00:30:29.810" style="s2">groceries.</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.126" end="00:30:32.110" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.810" end="00:30:35.110" style="s2">Buy low, sell high, the first rule of</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.110" end="00:30:36.912" style="s2">business. But this</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.110" end="00:30:38.412" style="s2">this is buying for pennies and selling</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.912" end="00:30:40.212" style="s2">for millions.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.412" end="00:30:41.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39; business.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.212" end="00:30:43.412" style="s2">This is alchemy.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.912" end="00:30:45.512" style="s2">Real alchemy.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.412" end="00:30:48.912" style="s2">Turning water into gold,</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.512" end="00:30:51.612" style="s2">rice into artifacts, a bodega into an</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.912" end="00:30:51.612" style="s2">empire.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.361" end="00:30:54.381" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.981" end="00:30:58.012" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.612" end="00:30:59.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More artifacts. The clan forged through</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.012" end="00:31:03.012" style="s2">the night.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.712" end="00:31:05.612" style="s2">20 rings of holding, 15 bracelets, 10</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.012" end="00:31:05.612" style="s2">amulets,</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.912" end="00:31:11.412" style="s2">and this, a dimensional compass, points</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.212" end="00:31:15.512" style="s2">to the nearest portal. Works anywhere in</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.412" end="00:31:15.512" style="s2">either world. I made it just for you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.612" end="00:31:22.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For me?</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.612" end="00:31:26.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re our most important client</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.312" end="00:31:26.412" style="s2">and a friend. Friends get gifts.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.512" end="00:31:36.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Borin.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.212" end="00:31:38.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stonefist clan,</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.112" end="00:31:41.012" style="s2">surrender every artifact, every ring of</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.512" end="00:31:43.112" style="s2">holding, every ingot of forged stock by</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.012" end="00:31:45.912" style="s2">sundown.</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.112" end="00:31:48.112" style="s2">Refuse, and this mountain becomes your</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.912" end="00:31:50.712" style="s2">tomb.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.112" end="00:31:53.512" style="s2">Stonefist clan, surrender every</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.712" end="00:31:56.412" style="s2">artifact, every ring of holding, every</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.512" end="00:31:58.912" style="s2">ingot of forged stock by sundown.</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.412" end="00:32:01.512" style="s2">Refuse, and this mountain becomes your</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.912" end="00:32:01.512" style="s2">tomb.</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.377" end="00:32:08.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.812" end="00:32:12.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They moved up the deadline.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.612" end="00:32:15.912" style="s2">6 hours till sundown. We don&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.912" end="00:32:15.912" style="s2">enough artifacts ready.</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.312" end="00:32:26.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then buy us time.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.512" end="00:32:30.812" style="s2">Send a messenger out. Tell them we need</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.912" end="00:32:30.812" style="s2">until dawn to gather everything.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.412" end="00:32:35.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They won&#39;t agree.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.312" end="00:32:37.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They will</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.712" end="00:32:38.813" style="s2">because they want our artifacts more</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.312" end="00:32:40.513" style="s2">than our blood.</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.813" end="00:32:44.513" style="s2">And while they wait,</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.513" end="00:32:44.513" style="s2">our forges burn hotter.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.113" end="00:32:49.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They will</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.613" end="00:32:51.013" style="s2">because they want our artifacts more</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.013" end="00:32:53.213" style="s2">than our blood.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.013" end="00:32:56.313" style="s2">And while they wait,</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.213" end="00:33:00.513" style="s2">he smiles.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.313" end="00:33:00.513" style="s2">Our forges burn hotter.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.017" end="00:33:06.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.672" end="00:33:06.692" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.713" end="00:33:10.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlet,</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.513" end="00:33:12.532" style="s2">the blue tower, they&#39;ve surrounded the</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.213" end="00:33:14.552" style="s2">stronghold.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.532" end="00:33:14.552" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.713" end="00:33:21.048" style="s2">Borin sent me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.013" end="00:33:22.113" style="s2">He needs more time.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.048" end="00:33:25.013" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.113" end="00:33:25.013" style="s2">He collapses.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.713" end="00:33:36.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kili,</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.613" end="00:33:38.788" style="s2">Kili, stay with me. How bad is it?</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.768" end="00:33:38.788" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.113" end="00:33:43.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 50 mages.</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.913" end="00:33:45.913" style="s2">Thorn came himself.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.013" end="00:33:45.913" style="s2">They gave us till dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.813" end="00:33:50.513" style="s2">Borin says the artifacts are almost</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.213" end="00:33:53.913" style="s2">ready, but he needs a distraction,</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.513" end="00:33:53.913" style="s2">something to make Thorn hesitate.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.013" end="00:33:57.313" style="s2">50 mages.</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.713" end="00:33:59.613" style="s2">Thorn came himself. They gave us till</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.313" end="00:33:59.613" style="s2">dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.713" end="00:34:02.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Borin says the artifacts are almost</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.513" end="00:34:04.513" style="s2">ready,</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.513" end="00:34:07.413" style="s2">but he needs a distraction,</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.513" end="00:34:09.813" style="s2">something to make Thorn hesitate.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.413" end="00:34:13.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A distraction, right.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.813" end="00:34:13.013" style="s2">I&#39;ve got exactly that.</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.313" end="00:34:18.313" style="s2">A distraction,</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.813" end="00:34:21.513" style="s2">right.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.313" end="00:34:21.513" style="s2">I&#39;ve got exactly that.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.373" end="00:34:38.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.713" end="00:34:46.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TIME IS DWARFS.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.414" end="00:34:46.814" style="s2">SURRENDER OR</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.314" end="00:34:54.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHANSHEN JUDGES OF the Blue Tower, you</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.314" end="00:34:57.814" style="s2">stand on sacred gland. This mountain is</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.914" end="00:34:57.814" style="s2">protected.</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.614" end="00:35:03.914" style="s2">Leave now</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.314" end="00:35:03.914" style="s2">or face judgment.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.314" end="00:35:11.314" style="s2">Mages of the Blue Tower, you stand on</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.514" end="00:35:14.514" style="s2">sacred ground. This mountain is</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.314" end="00:35:17.214" style="s2">protected. Leave now</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.514" end="00:35:18.914" style="s2">or face judgment.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.214" end="00:35:20.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT&#39;S A TRICK.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.914" end="00:35:23.114" style="s2">DWARVEN MACHINERY.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.914" end="00:35:23.114" style="s2">DON&#39;T</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.809" end="00:35:28.829" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.414" end="00:35:33.614" style="s2">THIS</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.714" end="00:35:41.114" style="s2">THIS ISN&#39;T OVER, Stone Fist. The Blue</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.714" end="00:35:41.114" style="s2">Tower does not forget.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.314" end="00:35:53.064" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Immortal girl.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.044" end="00:35:53.064" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.514" end="00:35:58.214" style="s2">With flashlights and a speaker.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.314" end="00:36:01.114" style="s2">Just scared off the most powerful mage</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.214" end="00:36:03.014" style="s2">order in Alloria. Immortal girl.</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.114" end="00:36:04.614" style="s2">With flashlights and a speaker. Just</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.014" end="00:36:06.014" style="s2">scared off the most powerful mage order</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.614" end="00:36:08.714" style="s2">in Alloria.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.014" end="00:36:12.114" style="s2">She said to tell you you&#39;re welcome and</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.714" end="00:36:12.114" style="s2">the artifacts better be ready.</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.714" end="00:36:19.210" style="s2">She said to tell you you&#39;re welcome</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.014" end="00:36:21.230" style="s2">and the artifacts better be ready.</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.210" end="00:36:21.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.614" end="00:36:25.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re ready.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.414" end="00:36:30.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET&#39;S GO MAKE HISTORY.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.514" end="00:36:38.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RINGS OF HOLDING. A hundred cubic feet</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.814" end="00:36:38.614" style="s2">of space.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.114" end="00:36:45.616" style="s2">Just 200 mana crystals.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.714" end="00:36:45.616" style="s2">Less than half the BLUE TOWER&#39;S PRICE.</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.916" end="00:36:49.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 200 CRYSTALS, THE BLUE TOWER SELLS A</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.716" end="00:36:51.716" style="s2">ring half THIS SIZE FOR 500.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.716" end="00:36:53.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dwarven master craftsmanship, quality</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.716" end="00:36:56.716" style="s2">guaranteed. Full refund within seven</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.416" end="00:36:56.716" style="s2">days if you&#39;re not satisfied.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.116" end="00:37:08.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 200 crystals? They&#39;re selling rings of</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.016" end="00:37:09.816" style="s2">holding for 200 crystals?</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.335" end="00:37:12.416" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.816" end="00:37:13.616" style="s2">That&#39;s below our production cost. How</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.416" end="00:37:15.616" style="s2">are they doing it?</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.616" end="00:37:18.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The dwarves, they found a new source of</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.616" end="00:37:20.116" style="s2">materials and the alchemist, Ashford,</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.016" end="00:37:22.416" style="s2">he&#39;s selling in every market.</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.116" end="00:37:25.116" style="s2">Valoria, the free cities, even the elven</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.416" end="00:37:26.916" style="s2">border. Our sales have dropped 90% in</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.116" end="00:37:28.616" style="s2">three days.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.916" end="00:37:29.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 90%</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.616" end="00:37:31.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.516" end="00:37:35.116" style="s2">can&#39;t pay the major salaries anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.616" end="00:37:35.116" style="s2">Half of them are threatening to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.516" end="00:37:40.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That mortal girl, she&#39;s behind all of</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.316" end="00:37:42.216" style="s2">this. The dwarves, the alchemist, the</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.216" end="00:37:43.716" style="s2">prince, she&#39;s the one pulling every</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.216" end="00:37:47.016" style="s2">string, all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.716" end="00:37:47.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do, Archmage?</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.316" end="00:37:52.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we change the rules. If we can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.016" end="00:37:56.116" style="s2">beat them in the market, we beat them on</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.616" end="00:37:58.816" style="s2">the battlefield. Mobilize the enforcers.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.116" end="00:38:02.216" style="s2">Take the stone, this mortal girl.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.816" end="00:38:06.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 12,000 mana crystals, three days.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.216" end="00:38:08.816" style="s2">At $40 a crystal, that&#39;s $480,000</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.616" end="00:38:11.416" style="s2">in three days for artifacts that cost</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.816" end="00:38:13.716" style="s2">maybe $5,000 of modern goods, rice,</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.416" end="00:38:15.416" style="s2">sunglasses, lighters, folding knives.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.716" end="00:38:17.916" style="s2">The blue tower has held a monopoly for</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.416" end="00:38:20.816" style="s2">500 years. Five centuries of price</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.916" end="00:38:22.216" style="s2">gouging, exploitation, control, and it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.816" end="00:38:24.916" style="s2">all about to end because of a</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.216" end="00:38:26.516" style="s2">20-year-old girl, a corner store, and a</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.916" end="00:38:29.516" style="s2">portal.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.516" end="00:38:31.816" style="s2">How&#39;s that for a legacy?</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.516" end="00:38:31.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlet,</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.916" end="00:38:36.916" style="s2">there&#39;s trouble. The blue tower is</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.516" end="00:38:37.916" style="s2">mobilizing, 300 enforcers.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.916" end="00:38:39.616" style="s2">They&#39;re marching on the Stonefist</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.916" end="00:38:41.716" style="s2">stronghold, and Thorn has put a bounty</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.616" end="00:38:43.916" style="s2">on your head, 10,000 mana crystals, dead</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.716" end="00:38:45.716" style="s2">or alive.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.916" end="00:38:47.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 300 enforcers</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.716" end="00:38:48.517" style="s2">against 400 dwarves, most of them</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.817" end="00:38:50.117" style="s2">not soldiers.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.517" end="00:38:52.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can hold the mountain,</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.117" end="00:38:54.917" style="s2">but not forever. They have mages, we</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.317" end="00:38:54.917" style="s2">have hammers.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.417" end="00:38:59.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not just hammers, you have artifacts,</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.517" end="00:39:01.317" style="s2">rings of holding, and me, your highness.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.917" end="00:39:03.317" style="s2">Can Valoria intervene?</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.317" end="00:39:04.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Blue Tower is beyond our borders.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.317" end="00:39:06.236" style="s2">Open war would ignite a continent-wide</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.817" end="00:39:07.217" style="s2">conflict.</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.236" end="00:39:08.717" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.217" end="00:39:10.717" style="s2">My father would never consent.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.717" end="00:39:14.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we don&#39;t need your army. We need</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.717" end="00:39:14.817" style="s2">your diplomacy and a distraction.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.717" end="00:39:25.117" style="s2">I have an idea.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.417" end="00:39:25.117" style="s2">It&#39;s insane.</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.217" end="00:39:29.717" style="s2">And it&#39;s going to take all of us.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.017" end="00:39:43.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thorn, the Grand Alliance is here.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.117" end="00:39:43.217" style="s2">Surrender or the Blue Tower falls.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.017" end="00:39:49.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think your little army can break the</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.717" end="00:39:52.717" style="s2">Blue Tower&#39;s shields?</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.817" end="00:39:53.417" style="s2">They have held for 500 YEARS AGAINST</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.717" end="00:39:54.917" style="s2">GODS.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.417" end="00:39:57.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE&#39;S NOT WRONG.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.917" end="00:39:59.017" style="s2">Those shields are strong.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.417" end="00:40:00.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re strong,</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.017" end="00:40:03.317" style="s2">but they run on mana crystals, and the</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.917" end="00:40:05.017" style="s2">Blue Tower&#39;s crystal reserves</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.317" end="00:40:07.217" style="s2">are exhausted</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.017" end="00:40:09.317" style="s2">because we cut off their supply,</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.217" end="00:40:12.617" style="s2">because no one trades with them anymore,</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.317" end="00:40:15.317" style="s2">because their economy has collapsed.</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.617" end="00:40:17.017" style="s2">How long can those shields hold?</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.317" end="00:40:18.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the current power output, about 6</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.017" end="00:40:19.117" style="s2">hours.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.017" end="00:40:19.817" style="s2">Then the crystals run dry and the</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.117" end="00:40:22.317" style="s2">shields drop.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.817" end="00:40:24.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we wait 6 hours.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.317" end="00:40:25.717" style="s2">The moment those shields fall,</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.617" end="00:40:27.417" style="s2">we go in.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.717" end="00:40:29.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Archmage, the shields won&#39;t hold. The</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.417" end="00:40:33.417" style="s2">crystals are almost gone.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.517" end="00:40:35.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then use the reserves, THE DEEP VAULT.</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.417" end="00:40:37.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE DEEP VAULT was raided last night.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.917" end="00:40:40.517" style="s2">Half the mages left.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.517" end="00:40:40.517" style="s2">They took the crystals.</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.517" end="00:40:46.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re all gone,</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.717" end="00:40:50.117" style="s2">collapsed in a few months</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.617" end="00:40:52.518" style="s2">because of a mortal girl.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.117" end="00:40:54.018" style="s2">She knows it. I know it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.518" end="00:40:55.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Archmage,</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.018" end="00:40:56.718" style="s2">do we surrender?</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.318" end="00:40:58.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.718" end="00:41:02.018" style="s2">The blue tower does not surrender. We</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.718" end="00:41:03.918" style="s2">fight. And if we fall, we fall fighting.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.018" end="00:41:05.518" style="s2">PREPARE THE FINAL DEFENSE. WE FALL, WE</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.918" end="00:41:08.718" style="s2">ALL MEET THEM IN THE COURTYARD. MAKE</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.518" end="00:41:08.718" style="s2">THEM PAY FOR EVERY INCH OF GROUND.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.653" end="00:41:14.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.273" end="00:41:17.293" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.218" end="00:41:24.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came yourself, an honor.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.718" end="00:41:28.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This ends here, Thorne. Just us. No more</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.518" end="00:41:30.918" style="s2">armies. No more sieges. You and me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.018" end="00:41:33.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A mortal challenging an archmage single</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.918" end="00:41:34.518" style="s2">combat. You are either very brave or</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.318" end="00:41:36.418" style="s2">very foolish.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.518" end="00:41:39.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came very well prepared.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.418" end="00:41:41.818" style="s2">This is an elixir. It doesn&#39;t heal. It</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.318" end="00:41:45.218" style="s2">doesn&#39;t hurt. It does something else. It</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.818" end="00:41:46.418" style="s2">strips away magic temporarily. About an</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.218" end="00:41:47.618" style="s2">hour.</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.418" end="00:41:49.518" style="s2">Long enough for you to know what it</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.618" end="00:41:51.318" style="s2">feels like to be mortal.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.518" end="00:41:53.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You would strip me of my magic?</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.318" end="00:41:54.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m giving you a choice. Surrender, step</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.018" end="00:41:55.918" style="s2">down, dissolve the blue tower&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.318" end="00:41:58.818" style="s2">monopoly, join the Grand Alliance as an</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.918" end="00:42:01.518" style="s2">equal, or drink this and fight me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.818" end="00:42:04.518" style="s2">Mortal against mortal, no magic, no</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.518" end="00:42:06.364" style="s2">staff, just you and me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.518" end="00:42:07.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if I refuse both?</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.364" end="00:42:08.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.018" end="00:42:11.604" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then Vorak eats you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.918" end="00:42:13.624" style="s2">He keeps asking.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.604" end="00:42:13.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.118" end="00:42:25.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have been archmage for 300 years. I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.518" end="00:42:27.818" style="s2">forgotten what it feels like to be</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.118" end="00:42:27.818" style="s2">ordinary.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.218" end="00:42:35.118" style="s2">I surrender.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.418" end="00:42:37.118" style="s2">The blue tower surrenders. We join your</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.118" end="00:42:38.618" style="s2">alliance on one condition.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.118" end="00:42:40.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Name it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.618" end="00:42:41.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The blue tower is not destroyed. Its</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.318" end="00:42:43.318" style="s2">mages are not punished. We have a place</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.818" end="00:42:45.218" style="s2">in the new world you&#39;re building.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.318" end="00:42:46.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal. There&#39;s a place for everyone,</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.218" end="00:42:48.618" style="s2">including you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.818" end="00:42:50.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlet, the woman who outsmarted the</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.618" end="00:42:51.559" style="s2">blue tower with a walkie-talkie and a</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.218" end="00:42:52.918" style="s2">spreadsheet.</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.559" end="00:42:53.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.918" end="00:42:54.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To all</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.120" end="00:42:55.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; of you,</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.020" end="00:42:58.020" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t have done this alone. Dwarven</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.820" end="00:43:00.920" style="s2">forges, alchemical sales, princely</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.020" end="00:43:02.120" style="s2">diplomacy, we&#39;re a team.</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.920" end="00:43:04.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Team?</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.120" end="00:43:06.320" style="s2">A team needs better communication. Right</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.920" end="00:43:07.820" style="s2">now we can only talk when someone walks</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.320" end="00:43:11.020" style="s2">through the portal. What if we need to</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.820" end="00:43:11.020" style="s2">reach EACH OTHER RIGHT NOW?</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.920" end="00:43:15.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ACTUALLY,</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.120" end="00:43:17.020" style="s2">I&#39;VE BEEN WORKING ON SOMETHING.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.220" end="00:43:18.820" style="s2">Borin forged it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.020" end="00:43:21.220" style="s2">A dimensional resonator</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.820" end="00:43:22.620" style="s2">amplifies the portal&#39;s signal.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.220" end="00:43:24.920" style="s2">If I&#39;m right, it should let us</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.620" end="00:43:25.820" style="s2">communicate across dimensions without</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.920" end="00:43:27.120" style="s2">walking through the portal.</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.820" end="00:43:29.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.120" end="00:43:31.515" style="s2">Anyone there? Borin?</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.120" end="00:43:33.220" style="s2">Are you at the GIRL&#39;S SHOP?</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.515" end="00:43:35.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.220" end="00:43:38.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GRANDFATHER, CAN YOU HEAR ME?</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.620" end="00:43:39.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LOUD AND CLEAR, BOY. What sorcery is</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.320" end="00:43:42.020" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.920" end="00:43:44.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not sorcery, Elder Thicken. It&#39;s well,</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.020" end="00:43:47.120" style="s2">it&#39;s magic, but it&#39;s also engineering.</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.420" end="00:43:49.720" style="s2">Borin built it. From now on, we can talk</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.120" end="00:43:49.720" style="s2">anytime.</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.820" end="00:43:56.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I dug up the real story behind</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.520" end="00:43:56.820" style="s2">Northbrook Properties.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.120" end="00:43:59.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And?</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.820" end="00:44:01.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a shell company owned by another</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.120" end="00:44:04.520" style="s2">shell company, owned by a trust, and the</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.520" end="00:44:06.230" style="s2">trust controller is Frank Kowalski, your</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.520" end="00:44:07.720" style="s2">stepfather.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.230" end="00:44:08.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.720" end="00:44:10.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank owns the company that holds my</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.820" end="00:44:12.420" style="s2">store&#39;s debt?</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.620" end="00:44:14.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He set the whole thing up.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.420" end="00:44:16.520" style="s2">He took out the original loan,</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.520" end="00:44:19.420" style="s2">rolled and refinanced it through his own</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.520" end="00:44:19.420" style="s2">shell companies,</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.520" end="00:44:24.620" style="s2">manufactured the 3 million debt, then</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.520" end="00:44:27.020" style="s2">vanished, waiting for you to default so</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.620" end="00:44:29.620" style="s2">he could seize the land.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.020" end="00:44:31.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The land is worth 15 million. He steals</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.620" end="00:44:34.320" style="s2">the store, sells the land, pockets 12</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.820" end="00:44:36.820" style="s2">million, and I take the fall.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.320" end="00:44:38.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s more. The Moretti family, they</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.820" end="00:44:40.820" style="s2">were never the real creditors. Just</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.820" end="00:44:45.220" style="s2">muscle Frank hired to scare you. The</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.820" end="00:44:45.220" style="s2">debt is entirely fake, manufactured.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.420" end="00:44:49.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I don&#39;t owe anyone a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.620" end="00:44:51.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Legally, you could contest it,</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.720" end="00:44:54.020" style="s2">but Frank covered his tracks. It would</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.420" end="00:44:54.321" style="s2">take years in court.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.020" end="00:44:57.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.321" end="00:44:59.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; a courtroom. I need Frank.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.321" end="00:45:03.921" style="s2">When he comes back, and he will once he</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.621" end="00:45:03.921" style="s2">hears I&#39;m not defaulting, I&#39;ll be ready.</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.321" end="00:45:09.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Warren, are you there? Something for me?</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.221" end="00:45:11.021" style="s2">Something special?</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.921" end="00:45:11.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, shopkeeper. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.021" end="00:45:13.221" style="s2">What do you need?</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.821" end="00:45:16.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A ring, but not a ring of holding. A</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.221" end="00:45:17.121" style="s2">ring that can open a portal anywhere,</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.421" end="00:45:19.421" style="s2">anytime.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.121" end="00:45:21.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A personal portal ring? That&#39;s arch</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.421" end="00:45:23.121" style="s2">master tier work. The Blue Tower studied</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.421" end="00:45:25.321" style="s2">it for a century and never made one.</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.121" end="00:45:26.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you?</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.321" end="00:45:29.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With the right materials</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.821" end="00:45:31.121" style="s2">plus your modern components, maybe.</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.721" end="00:45:32.121" style="s2">But it will take time.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.121" end="00:45:33.121" style="s2">And it&#39;s dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.121" end="00:45:34.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.121" end="00:45:36.721" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to be chained to this store</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.421" end="00:45:38.521" style="s2">forever. I want to step into Alaria</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.721" end="00:45:40.221" style="s2">whenever I choose</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.521" end="00:45:41.821" style="s2">and come back.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.221" end="00:45:44.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll begin tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.821" end="00:45:46.221" style="s2">But Scarlett, if this works, everything</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.821" end="00:45:48.421" style="s2">changes.</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.221" end="00:45:50.321" style="s2">You won&#39;t just be a merchant anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.421" end="00:45:53.221" style="s2">You&#39;ll be the woman who walks between</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.321" end="00:45:53.221" style="s2">two worlds.</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.921" end="00:45:58.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. That&#39;s the point.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.321" end="00:46:06.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dimensional anchors, quantum resonance</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.421" end="00:46:06.221" style="s2">by the gods might actually work.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.026" end="00:46:14.221" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.821" end="00:46:14.221" style="s2">Done.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.121" end="00:46:25.221" style="s2">The portal ring. Wear it and you can</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.621" end="00:46:26.921" style="s2">open a door between worlds anywhere,</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.221" end="00:46:28.121" style="s2">anytime.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.921" end="00:46:30.221" style="s2">But</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.121" end="00:46:32.021" style="s2">there are limits.</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.221" end="00:46:34.121" style="s2">You can only carry what you can hold on</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.021" end="00:46:36.621" style="s2">your person.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.121" end="00:46:39.502" style="s2">Each opening drains the ring&#39;s energy.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.621" end="00:46:40.621" style="s2">It needs time to recharge.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.502" end="00:46:43.121" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.621" end="00:46:44.421" style="s2">About once a day.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.121" end="00:46:47.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once a day.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.421" end="00:46:47.021" style="s2">That&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.321" end="00:46:51.821" style="s2">How do I use it?</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.021" end="00:46:53.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Picture where you want to go, then will</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.821" end="00:46:55.277" style="s2">the door open.</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.257" end="00:46:55.277" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.921" end="00:47:00.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It works.</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.117" end="00:47:03.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat and snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.422" end="00:47:07.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This mortal girl, she walks between two</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.922" end="00:47:08.922" style="s2">worlds.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.622" end="00:47:10.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elder Thiga,</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.922" end="00:47:13.323" style="s2">I believe you have some forging progress</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.422" end="00:47:15.523" style="s2">to show me. Here&#39;s what I&#39;m thinking.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.323" end="00:47:19.122" style="s2">Scale up production.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.523" end="00:47:21.723" style="s2">Three shifts, 24 hours a day. Rings of</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.122" end="00:47:22.823" style="s2">holding are our biggest seller, 1,000 a</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.723" end="00:47:25.723" style="s2">month,</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.823" end="00:47:27.622" style="s2">500 bracelets and amulets each. Then we</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.723" end="00:47:29.723" style="s2">open new markets. The elves want</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.622" end="00:47:31.723" style="s2">enchanted jewelry. The pirates want</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.723" end="00:47:34.023" style="s2">waterproof storage.</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.723" end="00:47:36.323" style="s2">The Spartans, well, the Spartans want</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.023" end="00:47:38.323" style="s2">weapons, lots of weapons.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.323" end="00:47:40.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think like a dwarf, always</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.323" end="00:47:42.723" style="s2">expanding, always producing.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.422" end="00:47:46.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think like someone carrying 3 million</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.723" end="00:47:47.823" style="s2">in fake debt who has something to prove</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.023" end="00:47:49.823" style="s2">and a stepfather to find.</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.823" end="00:47:52.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll help you find him.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.823" end="00:47:54.828" style="s2">And when he comes to take the store, he</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.122" end="00:47:56.023" style="s2">will we&#39;ll be ready.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.828" end="00:47:57.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.023" end="00:47:59.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good,</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.122" end="00:48:03.323" style="s2">because I&#39;m not waiting for him.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.422" end="00:48:03.323" style="s2">I&#39;m going to make him come to me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.422" end="00:48:13.323" style="s2">This is only the beginning.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.622" end="00:48:17.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; so loud and smoky.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.323" end="00:48:19.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elves so tall and stuck up.</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.323" end="00:48:21.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A personal portal ring, the relic the</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.223" end="00:48:22.823" style="s2">Blue Tower sought for centuries, and a</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.223" end="00:48:24.122" style="s2">mortal wears it like</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.823" end="00:48:26.523" style="s2">costume jewelry.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.122" end="00:48:28.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lytha Thanda, I presume.</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.523" end="00:48:30.922" style="s2">Welcome to the Stone Fist stronghold.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.823" end="00:48:34.223" style="s2">I&#39;m Scarlet Bennett.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.922" end="00:48:34.223" style="s2">I understand you wish to trade.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.622" end="00:48:38.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We are with Stealth and Linen Kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.023" end="00:48:45.823" style="s2">And tell Jed Glasses Sifch,</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.323" end="00:48:50.523" style="s2">we are especially intrigued by these.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.323" end="00:48:52.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five bucks.</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.523" end="00:48:53.323" style="s2">But for elves, I can do a wholesale</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.323" end="00:48:56.122" style="s2">price.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.323" end="00:48:56.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $5? A relic of such power cannot</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.122" end="00:48:58.723" style="s2">possibly cost</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.922" end="00:49:00.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Made in China, mass produced by the</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.723" end="00:49:03.024" style="s2">millions, but they</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.724" end="00:49:05.324" style="s2">They block the sun, they look cool, your</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.024" end="00:49:07.024" style="s2">people will love them.</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.324" end="00:49:09.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what do you wish in return?</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.024" end="00:49:11.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three things. One, Elven timber, the</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.724" end="00:49:12.724" style="s2">fireproof kind. We need it for artifact</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.624" end="00:49:15.424" style="s2">handles.</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.724" end="00:49:17.524" style="s2">Two, access to Elven healing magic.</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.424" end="00:49:20.724" style="s2">My friend William is old. I want him to</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.524" end="00:49:22.424" style="s2">have more years. Three, an alliance. If</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.724" end="00:49:24.024" style="s2">the Blue Tower comes after us again, the</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.424" end="00:49:25.524" style="s2">elves stand with us.</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.024" end="00:49:27.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Timber, yes.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.524" end="00:49:29.924" style="s2">Healing, perhaps.</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.324" end="00:49:33.624" style="s2">An alliance.</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.924" end="00:49:35.524" style="s2">Elves do not form alliance lightly.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.624" end="00:49:36.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then think about this.</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.524" end="00:49:38.324" style="s2">The Blue Tower has been cutting down</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.824" end="00:49:41.924" style="s2">your forest for 50 years to feed their</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.324" end="00:49:44.324" style="s2">forges. 50 years and you&#39;ve done nothing</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.924" end="00:49:46.224" style="s2">because of your isolationism. But now</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.324" end="00:49:47.924" style="s2">you have a partner.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.224" end="00:49:49.424" style="s2">Someone who can hit the Blue Tower where</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.924" end="00:49:51.124" style="s2">it hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.424" end="00:49:54.524" style="s2">Their wallet.</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.124" end="00:49:56.424" style="s2">An alliance with me isn&#39;t just politics.</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.524" end="00:49:58.424" style="s2">It&#39;s vengeance.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.424" end="00:49:59.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are dangerous, mortal girl.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.424" end="00:50:01.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I prefer efficient.</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.824" end="00:50:03.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sti sign.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.324" end="00:50:04.424" style="s2">The finer for the have efficients.</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.324" end="00:50:06.424" style="s2">Agreed.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.424" end="00:50:08.024" style="s2">All three. The queen will be delighted</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.424" end="00:50:10.524" style="s2">or furious. Either way, it will be</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.024" end="00:50:10.524" style="s2">interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.624" end="00:50:20.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sally Obanagen, scarlet sweetheart. Long</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.624" end="00:50:21.124" style="s2">time no see.</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.124" end="00:50:22.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank.</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.124" end="00:50:23.024" style="s2">I was wondering when you&#39;d so would show</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.424" end="00:50:24.724" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.024" end="00:50:25.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice place.</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.724" end="00:50:28.324" style="s2">You&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.924" end="00:50:31.324" style="s2">busy, I hear. The Morelli boys say</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.324" end="00:50:33.724" style="s2">you&#39;ve got money now. Mysterious money.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.324" end="00:50:35.124" style="s2">Antiques, gold.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.724" end="00:50:36.324" style="s2">Where does a girl like you get money</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.124" end="00:50:39.524" style="s2">like that?</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.324" end="00:50:41.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, it is my business.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.524" end="00:50:43.624" style="s2">Because this store, this land, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.824" end="00:50:45.524" style="s2">mine.</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.624" end="00:50:46.924" style="s2">Or rather, it will be mine once the debt</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.524" end="00:50:48.124" style="s2">defaults.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.924" end="00:50:50.424" style="s2">And you, little girl, are going to help</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.124" end="00:50:52.324" style="s2">me make that happen.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.424" end="00:50:54.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The debt is fake, Frank.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.324" end="00:50:58.224" style="s2">I know about Northbrook Properties.</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.924" end="00:50:58.224" style="s2">I know you manufactured it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.424" end="00:51:02.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know what you&#39;re talking</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.725" end="00:51:04.425" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.625" end="00:51:06.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know everything.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.425" end="00:51:07.925" style="s2">And I&#39;m not defaulting.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.025" end="00:51:10.325" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay off every cent, then this store</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.925" end="00:51:11.525" style="s2">is mine, free and clear.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.325" end="00:51:13.425" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.525" end="00:51:15.625" style="s2">You get nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.425" end="00:51:17.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think you can outplay me? I was</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.625" end="00:51:20.925" style="s2">working this game before you were born.</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.925" end="00:51:24.225" style="s2">You&#39;re a child, a stupid child with some</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.925" end="00:51:24.225" style="s2">money and a smart mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.725" end="00:51:30.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What what was that?</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.325" end="00:51:35.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That, Frank, is what happens when you</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.125" end="00:51:37.425" style="s2">touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.825" end="00:51:39.025" style="s2">Get out of my store.</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.425" end="00:51:40.525" style="s2">Don&#39;t come back</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.025" end="00:51:42.925" style="s2">unless you want to find out what else I</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.525" end="00:51:42.925" style="s2">can do.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.080" end="00:51:45.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.625" end="00:51:49.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t over.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.825" end="00:51:49.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For you, it is.</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.320" end="00:51:51.825" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.975" end="00:51:52.925" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.825" end="00:51:55.325" style="s2">Edmund,</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.925" end="00:51:58.225" style="s2">he came. Frank, I think I just made him</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.325" end="00:51:58.225" style="s2">very very angry.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.325" end="00:52:06.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;re the merchant everyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.825" end="00:52:09.025" style="s2">jabbering about, the mortal girl with</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.825" end="00:52:10.725" style="s2">the artifacts. Don&#39;t look like much.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.025" end="00:52:13.625" style="s2">Looks can be deceiving. I hear you need</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.725" end="00:52:14.625" style="s2">storage, waterproof storage for your</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.625" end="00:52:17.325" style="s2">goods.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.625" end="00:52:18.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Goods. I like that word. Aye, we need</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.325" end="00:52:21.525" style="s2">storage. The Blue Towers rings are</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.725" end="00:52:23.125" style="s2">rubbish. They leak, ruin the cargo, and</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.525" end="00:52:24.825" style="s2">cost a king&#39;s ransom.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.125" end="00:52:27.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got better. Dwarven-made,</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.825" end="00:52:27.825" style="s2">waterproof, shockproof, custom sizes,</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.125" end="00:52:30.525" style="s2">fair price.</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.825" end="00:52:31.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what&#39;s your price?</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.525" end="00:52:35.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gold,</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.525" end="00:52:36.225" style="s2">monocrystals, and information.</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.225" end="00:52:38.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Information?</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.225" end="00:52:40.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pirates control the sea lanes. You hear</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.325" end="00:52:41.425" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.125" end="00:52:45.325" style="s2">I want to know when the Blue Tower</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.425" end="00:52:47.525" style="s2">moves, when they buy, when they sell.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.325" end="00:52:48.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.525" end="00:52:52.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I want to know if anyone&#39;s looking</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.825" end="00:52:53.225" style="s2">for a way into my world.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.025" end="00:52:54.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want intelligence.</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.225" end="00:52:56.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to stay one step ahead. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.725" end="00:52:57.725" style="s2">willing to pay for it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.131" end="00:53:00.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.725" end="00:53:02.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like you, girl. You&#39;ve got guts. Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.425" end="00:53:04.927" style="s2">Rings for gold, crystals, and</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.225" end="00:53:07.727" style="s2">information. But you cross me,</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.927" end="00:53:09.886" style="s2">You&#39;ll keel harm me. I know.</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.727" end="00:53:11.906" style="s2">I&#39;ve read the books.</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.886" end="00:53:11.906" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.027" end="00:53:18.127" style="s2">Books. I like books, too. Welcome to the</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.127" end="00:53:18.127" style="s2">Isles, merchant.</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.527" end="00:53:24.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the merchant.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.927" end="00:53:26.227" style="s2">The one selling rings of holding.</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.827" end="00:53:27.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.227" end="00:53:28.927" style="s2">I understand the Spartan legions need</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.827" end="00:53:29.827" style="s2">weapons.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.927" end="00:53:31.727" style="s2">Better weapons.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.827" end="00:53:33.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our steel is good.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.727" end="00:53:35.127" style="s2">The Lantaur&#39;s javelins and weapons are</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.427" end="00:53:36.827" style="s2">better. We can&#39;t match them.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.127" end="00:53:39.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I told you I can get you weapons</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.827" end="00:53:41.527" style="s2">that don&#39;t need enchantment? The</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.627" end="00:53:42.727" style="s2">stronger and tougher than anything in</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.527" end="00:53:44.127" style="s2">Aloria?</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.727" end="00:53:45.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Such weapons exist?</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.127" end="00:53:47.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my world.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.627" end="00:53:50.427" style="s2">High carbon steel,</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.227" end="00:53:53.727" style="s2">titanium alloys, ceramic blades. We make</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.427" end="00:53:57.127" style="s2">them by the thousand. No magic needed.</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.727" end="00:53:57.127" style="s2">Just better steel.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.667" end="00:54:03.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.827" end="00:54:05.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This edge is keener than our finest</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.027" end="00:54:08.327" style="s2">bronze, and the metal lighter.</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.327" end="00:54:11.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Plus swords, axes, armor.</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.327" end="00:54:12.827" style="s2">All modern steel. The</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.127" end="00:54:13.827" style="s2">In exchange, I want one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.827" end="00:54:15.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Name it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.827" end="00:54:17.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shulian lions.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.527" end="00:54:18.927" style="s2">If I ever need an army, a real army, not</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.527" end="00:54:22.127" style="s2">dwarfish smiths with hammers, the</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.927" end="00:54:25.227" style="s2">Spartan legions answer.</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.127" end="00:54:25.227" style="s2">Fair pay, of course.</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.522" end="00:54:28.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.327" end="00:54:33.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to hire the Spartan legions?</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.227" end="00:54:34.527" style="s2">Immortal girl carrying a blade sharper</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.527" end="00:54:37.927" style="s2">than our swords.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.527" end="00:54:39.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like to be prepared, and I pay well.</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.927" end="00:54:42.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.627" end="00:54:45.527" style="s2">The legions do not forget their friends,</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.527" end="00:54:45.527" style="s2">nor their enemies.</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.727" end="00:55:00.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elves, pirates, Spartans in a single</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.327" end="00:55:01.727" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.427" end="00:55:04.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And a dragon.</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.727" end="00:55:06.227" style="s2">Vorath the Scaled tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.027" end="00:55:07.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vorath the Scaled? HE&#39;S A DRAGON LORD.</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.227" end="00:55:08.328" style="s2">HE EATS PEOPLE.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.527" end="00:55:10.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He also hoards</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.328" end="00:55:12.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; gold, and I have a lot of gold to sell.</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.328" end="00:55:13.728" style="s2">Besides, dragons fly. If I ever need</p>
<p begin="00:55:12.028" end="00:55:15.628" style="s2">something big and heavy moved, dragons</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.728" end="00:55:16.728" style="s2">are the answer.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.628" end="00:55:17.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to do business with a</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.728" end="00:55:19.928" style="s2">dragon?</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.728" end="00:55:22.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to do business with everyone</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.928" end="00:55:24.628" style="s2">because the more allies I have, the less</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.428" end="00:55:26.928" style="s2">the blue tower can touch me, and the</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.628" end="00:55:29.328" style="s2">less Frank can touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.928" end="00:55:33.528" style="s2">This isn&#39;t just trade anymore. It</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.328" end="00:55:33.528" style="s2">is building something unbreakable.</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.228" end="00:55:40.128" style="s2">Tomorrow, the dragon.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.528" end="00:55:43.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A mortal</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.128" end="00:55:43.328" style="s2">in my lair.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.528" end="00:55:48.828" style="s2">The last mortal who came here tried to</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.728" end="00:55:50.728" style="s2">steal my gold. I ate him.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.828" end="00:55:53.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not here to steal.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.728" end="00:55:56.528" style="s2">I&#39;m here to trade.</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.128" end="00:55:56.528" style="s2">And I have something you want.</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.628" end="00:56:02.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, and what might that be, little</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.028" end="00:56:05.828" style="s2">mortal?</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.828" end="00:56:10.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More gold, better gold, not dug from</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.828" end="00:56:12.528" style="s2">mines, from somewhere else, pure gold,</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.028" end="00:56:14.128" style="s2">24 karat bullion [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.528" end="00:56:15.828" style="s2">by the ton.</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.128" end="00:56:18.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By the ton.</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.828" end="00:56:21.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By the ton. I have access to a world</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.628" end="00:56:25.328" style="s2">where gold is common.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.628" end="00:56:27.828" style="s2">Companies mine it, refineries purify it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.328" end="00:56:29.528" style="s2">You want more, you get more.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.828" end="00:56:30.928" style="s2">In exchange,</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.528" end="00:56:31.728" style="s2">I want three things.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.928" end="00:56:33.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speak.</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.728" end="00:56:35.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One, transport. If I need something big,</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.628" end="00:56:36.928" style="s2">heavy, or fast moved across Ellaria, you</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.028" end="00:56:38.528" style="s2">provide dragons, paid, of course. Two,</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.928" end="00:56:40.328" style="s2">protection. If the blue tower attacks my</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.528" end="00:56:41.928" style="s2">allies, your dragons are our air force.</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.328" end="00:56:43.228" style="s2">Three, intelligence. Dragons see</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.928" end="00:56:44.428" style="s2">everything from the sky. I want to know</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.228" end="00:56:45.428" style="s2">what the blue tower is doing, where</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.428" end="00:56:47.828" style="s2">they&#39;re moving troops, what they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.428" end="00:56:47.828" style="s2">building.</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.428" end="00:56:55.528" style="s2">Very rich</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.728" end="00:56:55.528" style="s2">and getting richer.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.628" end="00:57:05.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take this. It is a dragon bond. Break</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.928" end="00:57:07.128" style="s2">your word, and I will find you, then eat</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.828" end="00:57:09.128" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.128" end="00:57:14.329" style="s2">But keep your oath, and the dragons of</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.128" end="00:57:14.329" style="s2">Ash Peak your call within reason.</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.229" end="00:57:23.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.129" end="00:57:32.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.229" end="00:57:34.829" style="s2">a dragon scale?</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.629" end="00:57:37.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, which means I now have dwarves,</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.829" end="00:57:39.094" style="s2">elves, humans, pirates, Spartans, and</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.029" end="00:57:39.529" style="s2">dragons on my side.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.094" end="00:57:41.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.529" end="00:57:42.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve built an alliance in a matter of</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.929" end="00:57:44.529" style="s2">weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.929" end="00:57:46.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not an alliance,</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.529" end="00:57:48.529" style="s2">an empire,</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.129" end="00:57:50.329" style="s2">a trade empire.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.529" end="00:57:52.229" style="s2">The Blue Tower is about to find out what</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.329" end="00:57:54.129" style="s2">happens when you monopolize an entire</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.229" end="00:57:56.729" style="s2">world&#39;s economy and someone decides to</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.129" end="00:57:56.729" style="s2">compete.</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.729" end="00:58:02.529" style="s2">Here&#39;s the plan. Phase one, we flood the</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.829" end="00:58:04.129" style="s2">market with cheap rings and artifacts.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.529" end="00:58:05.929" style="s2">Done. The Blue Tower&#39;s revenue is down</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.129" end="00:58:07.829" style="s2">90%.</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.929" end="00:58:09.529" style="s2">Phase two, we expand our product lines.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.829" end="00:58:11.029" style="s2">Modern steel weapons for the Spartans,</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.529" end="00:58:12.529" style="s2">waterproof storage for the pirates,</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.029" end="00:58:14.829" style="s2">enchanted jewelry for the elves, healing</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.529" end="00:58:16.729" style="s2">potions for everyone. Phase three, we</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.829" end="00:58:19.129" style="s2">create a new currency, the Bennett</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.729" end="00:58:21.329" style="s2">Standard, backed by gold, mana crystals,</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.129" end="00:58:24.729" style="s2">and artifacts. Every faction in Aldoria</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.329" end="00:58:26.629" style="s2">uses it. And the Blue Tower, left out.</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.729" end="00:58:27.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re replacing the Blue Tower&#39;s entire</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.629" end="00:58:31.129" style="s2">economic system.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.929" end="00:58:32.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to make them irrelevant.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.129" end="00:58:35.529" style="s2">And once they&#39;re irrelevant, they can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.629" end="00:58:39.029" style="s2">hurt anyone, not my clan, not my</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.529" end="00:58:39.029" style="s2">friends, not me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.829" end="00:58:43.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Frank?</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.940" end="00:58:47.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.929" end="00:58:48.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank is a small problem. He&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.029" end="00:58:51.129" style="s2">handled.</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.429" end="00:58:55.429" style="s2">The Blue Tower is the big problem, and</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.129" end="00:58:55.429" style="s2">I&#39;ll solve it with a spreadsheet.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.129" end="00:59:03.529" style="s2">You all know why you&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.029" end="00:59:06.329" style="s2">The Blue Tower has controlled this</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.529" end="00:59:08.529" style="s2">world&#39;s economy for 500 years.</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.329" end="00:59:11.529" style="s2">They set the prices. They control the</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.529" end="00:59:14.431" style="s2">artifacts. They hoard the mana crystals.</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.529" end="00:59:16.631" style="s2">Anyone who challenges them, they attack.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.431" end="00:59:18.731" style="s2">They besieged the Stone Fist clan. They</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.631" end="00:59:20.531" style="s2">exiled Elias and William. They&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.731" end="00:59:22.931" style="s2">felling the Elven forest. They&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.531" end="00:59:26.231" style="s2">price gagging the free cities.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.931" end="00:59:28.931" style="s2">Today, that all ends.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.231" end="00:59:31.431" style="s2">I propose the Grand Alliance, a trade</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.931" end="00:59:34.231" style="s2">pact between every power in this room.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.431" end="00:59:36.231" style="s2">We set fair prices. We share resources.</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.231" end="00:59:39.131" style="s2">We protect each other.</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.231" end="00:59:41.131" style="s2">We build a new economy, one that doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.131" end="00:59:42.831" style="s2">depend on the Blue Tower.</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.131" end="00:59:44.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The elves agree.</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.831" end="00:59:45.631" style="s2">The Blue Tower has taken too much from</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.831" end="00:59:47.531" style="s2">our forests.</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.631" end="00:59:49.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The pirates agree. The Blue Tower&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.531" end="00:59:51.631" style="s2">tariffs are robbery.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.331" end="00:59:53.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Spartans provide security,</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.631" end="00:59:55.231" style="s2">protecting travelers, protecting trade</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.931" end="00:59:57.431" style="s2">routes.</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.231" end="00:59:58.031" style="s2">The dragons agree because it sounds like</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.431" end="01:00:00.331" style="s2">fun.</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.031" end="01:00:03.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Valoria agrees. The crown provides</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.331" end="01:00:05.431" style="s2">governance, structure, law.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.231" end="01:00:09.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The dwarves agree. We&#39;ve been enslaved</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.431" end="01:00:09.631" style="s2">BY THE BLUE TOWER FOR TOO LONG.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.231" end="01:00:14.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it&#39;s settled.</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.831" end="01:00:16.831" style="s2">The Grand Alliance is formed. First</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.831" end="01:00:19.031" style="s2">order of business, we invite the Blue</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.831" end="01:00:20.431" style="s2">Tower to join on our terms.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.031" end="01:00:22.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Invite them after everything they&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.431" end="01:00:22.831" style="s2">done?</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.831" end="01:00:27.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they join, they become one voice</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.031" end="01:00:29.331" style="s2">among many.</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.331" end="01:00:32.131" style="s2">They lose the monopoly but keep their</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.331" end="01:00:33.931" style="s2">power. If they refuse,</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.131" end="01:00:35.731" style="s2">they face the combined economic and</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.931" end="01:00:37.531" style="s2">military mouse of every power in</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.731" end="01:00:40.331" style="s2">Valoria.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.531" end="01:00:40.331" style="s2">Their choice.</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.131" end="01:00:46.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Archmage,</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.331" end="01:00:48.731" style="s2">what does it say?</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.231" end="01:00:50.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve allied every power.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.731" end="01:00:53.031" style="s2">Dwarves, elves, humans, pirates,</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.931" end="01:00:56.731" style="s2">Spartans, dragons,</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.031" end="01:00:56.731" style="s2">all of them against us.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.431" end="01:01:01.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This this this can&#39;t be. The elves don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.131" end="01:01:03.831" style="s2">ally with dwarves. Pirates don&#39;t ally</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.631" end="01:01:06.077" style="s2">with anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.831" end="01:01:07.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That mortal girl did it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.077" end="01:01:10.131" style="s2">[snorts] She gave them a common enemy,</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.731" end="01:01:10.131" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.731" end="01:01:14.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One world, one</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.331" end="01:01:20.032" style="s2">We do not join. We do not become one</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.032" end="01:01:23.232" style="s2">voice among many.</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.032" end="01:01:24.932" style="s2">We are the blue tower. We are the power</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.232" end="01:01:26.232" style="s2">of this world.</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.932" end="01:01:28.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BUT ARCHMAGE,</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.232" end="01:01:30.832" style="s2">OUR REVENUE IS GONE. OUR MAGES ARE</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.432" end="01:01:33.932" style="s2">LEAVING. WE CAN&#39;T FIGHT AN ALLIANCE OF</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.832" end="01:01:33.932" style="s2">EVERY POWER.</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.632" end="01:01:40.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEN WE DON&#39;T FIGHT THEM.</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.132" end="01:01:43.632" style="s2">We fight her, that mortal girl,</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.932" end="01:01:45.832" style="s2">the source of everything. Without her,</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.632" end="01:01:48.032" style="s2">the alliance collapses. The dwarves go</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.832" end="01:01:51.832" style="s2">back to forging, the elves back to their</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.032" end="01:01:54.032" style="s2">forests, the pirates back to raiding.</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.832" end="01:01:56.532" style="s2">It all falls apart.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.032" end="01:01:58.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But she is another world. We can&#39;t reach</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.532" end="01:01:58.732" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.232" end="01:02:04.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t we? I&#39;ve been studying the</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.532" end="01:02:06.632" style="s2">dimensional resonance between her world</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.132" end="01:02:09.932" style="s2">and ours.</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.632" end="01:02:12.532" style="s2">It&#39;s weakening. Other passages I will</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.932" end="01:02:12.532" style="s2">find one.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.232" end="01:02:21.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlet Bennett,</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.932" end="01:02:25.632" style="s2">I know who you are. I know what you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.832" end="01:02:25.632" style="s2">done, and I know where you live.</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.732" end="01:02:28.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thorn,</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.932" end="01:02:30.632" style="s2">I was wondering when you&#39;d call.</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.732" end="01:02:31.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have disturbed the natural order of</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.632" end="01:02:34.232" style="s2">this world.</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.932" end="01:02:36.732" style="s2">You have armed our enemies.</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.232" end="01:02:39.532" style="s2">You have destroyed our economy. You will</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.732" end="01:02:41.832" style="s2">cease or you will be destroyed.</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.532" end="01:02:44.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or what? You&#39;ll send mages through the</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.832" end="01:02:45.732" style="s2">portal? Good luck. My store is</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.132" end="01:02:47.032" style="s2">protected. I will and I will bonus</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.732" end="01:02:50.832" style="s2">sandwich you, and I&#39;ve got a brazer that</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.032" end="01:02:50.832" style="s2">reflects anything below Archmage level.</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.732" end="01:02:55.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think your little tricks can shield</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.132" end="01:02:57.532" style="s2">you from me? I am Archmage Dath&#39;oster. I</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.432" end="01:03:01.532" style="s2">have lived 300 years.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.532" end="01:03:01.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have destroyed kingdoms.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.013" end="01:03:04.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.232" end="01:03:10.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will find a way into your world, and</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.232" end="01:03:10.132" style="s2">when I do</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.532" end="01:03:15.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thorn, Thorn just contacted me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.432" end="01:03:17.933" style="s2">He&#39;s looking for another portal into my</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.232" end="01:03:19.533" style="s2">world. We We to find it first and be</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.933" end="01:03:22.133" style="s2">ready.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.533" end="01:03:23.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll rally the clan. Elius will alert</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.133" end="01:03:25.733" style="s2">the guild.</p>
<p begin="01:03:23.333" end="01:03:26.833" style="s2">Valerius will mobilize the crown. And</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.733" end="01:03:27.733" style="s2">Scarlett?</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.833" end="01:03:30.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm?</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.733" end="01:03:34.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be careful. Thorn doesn&#39;t make threats.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.933" end="01:03:34.133" style="s2">He makes promises.</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.533" end="01:03:41.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we better make sure he can&#39;t keep</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.933" end="01:03:41.433" style="s2">this one.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.933" end="01:03:57.533" style="s2">Found it. He wasn&#39;t bluffing.</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.533" end="01:04:03.333" style="s2">If he can come through here, then I can</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.533" end="01:04:03.333" style="s2">go through there.</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.133" end="01:04:09.533" style="s2">This will be our forward operating base.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.033" end="01:04:12.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Almost.</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.533" end="01:04:15.533" style="s2">Soon I will walk into her world</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.733" end="01:04:15.533" style="s2">and end this.</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.233" end="01:04:20.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arch master, the Grand Alliance has</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.033" end="01:04:22.433" style="s2">issued an ultimatum. Join the trade pact</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.433" end="01:04:24.833" style="s2">or face total economic sanctions. Every</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.433" end="01:04:27.633" style="s2">power has cut ties with us. Our mana</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.833" end="01:04:30.633" style="s2">crystal reserves are depleted.</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.633" end="01:04:32.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them sanction. Let them cut ties.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.633" end="01:04:34.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once that mortal girl is dead, the</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.533" end="01:04:36.733" style="s2">alliance collapses.</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.333" end="01:04:37.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The blue tower will be stronger than</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.733" end="01:04:39.533" style="s2">ever.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.233" end="01:04:41.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But arch master, the mages, half of them</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.533" end="01:04:43.433" style="s2">have already left.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.333" end="01:04:45.933" style="s2">They joined the dwarves, the elves, even</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.433" end="01:04:49.733" style="s2">the pirates.</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.933" end="01:04:52.533" style="s2">We have fewer than 100 enforcers left.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.733" end="01:04:55.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we don&#39;t need an army.</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.533" end="01:04:57.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need one mage.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.233" end="01:05:01.033" style="s2">Me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.333" end="01:05:04.933" style="s2">I will step through that portal</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.033" end="01:05:04.933" style="s2">and kill her myself.</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.833" end="01:05:09.333" style="s2">IT IS TIME.</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.704" end="01:05:14.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.933" end="01:05:15.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s opening the portal</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.633" end="01:05:18.533" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.933" end="01:05:19.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. I can feel it. The crack here is</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.533" end="01:05:19.635" style="s2">widening.</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.233" end="01:05:23.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thorn, we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.635" end="01:05:24.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; coming. The clan, Elias, Valerius, we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.735" end="01:05:27.335" style="s2">on our</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.335" end="01:05:28.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. This is my world, my fight. If you</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.335" end="01:05:31.735" style="s2">come through, it&#39;ll destabilize the</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.635" end="01:05:33.635" style="s2">portal. Thorn might slip back through.</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.735" end="01:05:34.335" style="s2">I have to handle this here</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.635" end="01:05:37.635" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.335" end="01:05:38.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thorn alone? HE&#39;S AN ARCHMAGE. THORN 300</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.635" end="01:05:40.135" style="s2">YEARS OLD.</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.335" end="01:05:42.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE&#39;LL WALK INTO a warehouse full of</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.135" end="01:05:44.535" style="s2">dwarven masterwork, elven warding rules,</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.635" end="01:05:46.335" style="s2">and one very angry woman wearing a</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.535" end="01:05:50.635" style="s2">bracer that deflects anything below</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.335" end="01:05:50.635" style="s2">archmage level. And I&#39;ve got more.</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.135" end="01:05:57.235" style="s2">I&#39;ve got a dragon on speed dial.</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.335" end="01:05:57.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re terrifying.</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.835" end="01:06:01.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. Wish me luck.</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.535" end="01:06:12.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett Bennett,</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.435" end="01:06:13.335" style="s2">we finally meet.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.235" end="01:06:15.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thorn,</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.335" end="01:06:17.635" style="s2">welcome to Chicago. Sorry about the</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.435" end="01:06:19.135" style="s2">decor. I was going for creepy warehouse,</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.635" end="01:06:20.335" style="s2">but I think I landed on abandoned</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.135" end="01:06:21.935" style="s2">storage unit.</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.335" end="01:06:23.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will come with me</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.935" end="01:06:26.235" style="s2">back to Elloria.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.535" end="01:06:28.735" style="s2">You will dissolve the alliance.</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.235" end="01:06:30.835" style="s2">You will return every artifact. You will</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.735" end="01:06:31.935" style="s2">never cross dimensions again.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.835" end="01:06:33.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or what?</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.935" end="01:06:35.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or I kill you</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.535" end="01:06:37.035" style="s2">AND EVERYONE YOU CARE ABOUT.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.235" end="01:06:39.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Starting with the dwarf, then the</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.035" end="01:06:43.135" style="s2">alchemist, then the prince, then the</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.535" end="01:06:43.135" style="s2">antiquities dealer, then</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.935" end="01:06:48.435" style="s2">What what is this?</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.735" end="01:06:50.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This thorn is elven warding. Every rune</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.435" end="01:06:53.235" style="s2">carved by Lythander himself. They</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.335" end="01:06:56.435" style="s2">suppress magic, all magic,</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.235" end="01:06:56.435" style="s2">including yours.</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.816" end="01:07:01.235" style="s2">[sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.035" end="01:07:02.735" style="s2">And in case the runes fail,</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.235" end="01:07:04.035" style="s2">I&#39;ve got this</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.735" end="01:07:06.835" style="s2">and this</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.035" end="01:07:06.835" style="s2">and this.</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.735" end="01:07:20.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do believe you were just threatening</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.435" end="01:07:22.135" style="s2">my merchant.</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.635" end="01:07:23.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This This be.</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.135" end="01:07:23.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Thorn.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.535" end="01:07:25.636" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.736" end="01:07:27.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is economics and logistics and</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.636" end="01:07:29.536" style="s2">alliances. Everything you thought you</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.936" end="01:07:30.936" style="s2">controlled,</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.536" end="01:07:31.936" style="s2">I organized it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.936" end="01:07:33.936" style="s2">And now</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.936" end="01:07:35.636" style="s2">you&#39;re outnumbered</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.936" end="01:07:37.036" style="s2">and out of magic.</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.636" end="01:07:41.236" style="s2">Surrender</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.036" end="01:07:41.236" style="s2">or the dragon eats you. Your choice.</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.636" end="01:07:48.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think elven runes can hold an</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.136" end="01:07:48.736" style="s2">archmaster forever?</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.456" end="01:07:57.476" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.736" end="01:08:00.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He got away,</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.036" end="01:08:03.536" style="s2">but now he knows.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.536" end="01:08:03.536" style="s2">He knows we can find him.</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.036" end="01:08:11.036" style="s2">Borin, he came. I held him off,</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.136" end="01:08:14.536" style="s2">but he escaped back through.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.036" end="01:08:15.836" style="s2">We need to go on the offensive now</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.536" end="01:08:18.336" style="s2">before he recovers.</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.836" end="01:08:20.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The clan is ready. The elves are ready.</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.336" end="01:08:24.036" style="s2">The Spartans are ready. The dragons are</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.436" end="01:08:24.036" style="s2">ready. JUST GIVE THE ORDER.</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.236" end="01:08:29.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The order is now.</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.436" end="01:08:32.036" style="s2">We march on the Blue Tower</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.536" end="01:08:32.036" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
